(593785, 61333, 9906, '<td valign="top">Painting with light style!  It appears that you were not real even with your moving of the light around.  THis would explain some of the more (or less) lit areas.  Great job none the less!  One thing I would think about if you attempt re-shoots...  I think the chair would look like it fits better in the frame if it was pointed into the frame rather than out of it.<br/>TC</td>', 'Painting with light style!  It appears that you were not real even with your moving of the light around.  THis would explain some of the more (or less) lit areas.  Great job none the less!  One thing I would think about if you attempt re-shoots...  I think the chair would look like it fits better in the frame if it was pointed into the frame rather than out of it.TC', '2004-02-23 00:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
