(593915, 61586, 245, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a lot tighter if the gap or shadow in the middle of the top edge weren''t there... it''s a distracting little detail in an otherwise regular field.</td>', 'I think this would be a lot tighter if the gap or shadow in the middle of the top edge weren''t there... it''s a distracting little detail in an otherwise regular field.', '2004-02-23 03:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
