(594026, 61018, 14453, '<td valign="top">It has a recently Déjà vu feeling... Technically the focus and the light are excellent.  But since it was an advanced editing challenge, I would had like to not see any dust on the jack and on the lower background. My opinion!</td>', 'It has a recently Déjà vu feeling... Technically the focus and the light are excellent.  But since it was an advanced editing challenge, I would had like to not see any dust on the jack and on the lower background. My opinion!', '2004-02-23 07:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
