(594034, 61701, 4543, '<td valign="top">I agree - straws are ordinary things that you can make it look extraordinary.  I''ve seen this but is as great as them.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I agree - straws are ordinary things that you can make it look extraordinary.  I''ve seen this but is as great as them.  Good Luck!', '2004-02-23 07:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
