(594233, 61537, 4285, '<td valign="top">Mundane no doubt. Compostionally, I find that the mini blinds are very distracting. A plain black background or a backlit white background would have worked better in my opinion.</td>', 'Mundane no doubt. Compostionally, I find that the mini blinds are very distracting. A plain black background or a backlit white background would have worked better in my opinion.', '2004-02-23 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
