(594356, 61379, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  And well taken (specifically, the lighting and background) to boot.</td>', 'Very clever.  And well taken (specifically, the lighting and background) to boot.', '2004-02-23 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(594366, 61761, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like how the string looks coiled and ready to strike.</td>', 'I like how the string looks coiled and ready to strike.', '2004-02-23 10:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(594368, 61537, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good reflection of the blinds on the tabletop.</td>', 'Good reflection of the blinds on the tabletop.', '2004-02-23 10:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(594377, 61751, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool photo. Very original idea, great use of color and shapes. My pick for 1st place. Well done!</td>', 'This is a very cool photo. Very original idea, great use of color and shapes. My pick for 1st place. Well done!', '2004-02-23 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(594382, 61334, 16230, '<td valign="top">You managed to make a watch look very interesting. Great use of color, and the composition is good too. Well done!</td>', 'You managed to make a watch look very interesting. Great use of color, and the composition is good too. Well done!', '2004-02-23 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(594399, 61807, 13136, '<td valign="top">The slight angle of this shot along with the golden reflections make this very interesting.</td>', 'The slight angle of this shot along with the golden reflections make this very interesting.', '2004-02-23 10:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(594408, 60733, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice Capture but I feel the Glas plate under the orange distracts more than enhances the picture</td>', 'Nice Capture but I feel the Glas plate under the orange distracts more than enhances the picture', '2004-02-23 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(594417, 61537, 16216, '<td valign="top">Fix the bent blind and would have bee a good capture, the blind is a distractor that takes away from your image</td>', 'Fix the bent blind and would have bee a good capture, the blind is a distractor that takes away from your image', '2004-02-23 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(594419, 61708, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very unique and interesting.</td>', 'Very unique and interesting.', '2004-02-23 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(594423, 60944, 16216, '<td valign="top">I feel your depth of field which causes the two front wisk to be out of focus in some instance makes it feel like motion, but IMO I would of like to see it Sharp</td>', 'I feel your depth of field which causes the two front wisk to be out of focus in some instance makes it feel like motion, but IMO I would of like to see it Sharp', '2004-02-23 10:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(594431, 61751, 16216, '<td valign="top">I Like it, makes a great inspirational poster</td>', 'I Like it, makes a great inspirational poster', '2004-02-23 10:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(594436, 61414, 16216, '<td valign="top">I would have made sure my Marble that is center stage was Perfect without scratches, It tends to pull your eye away from the picture as a whole, otherwise nice capture</td>', 'I would have made sure my Marble that is center stage was Perfect without scratches, It tends to pull your eye away from the picture as a whole, otherwise nice capture', '2004-02-23 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(594441, 61810, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice, I can feel the breeze</td>', 'Nice, I can feel the breeze', '2004-02-23 10:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(594454, 61648, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, my only wish was the top dock was also in focus , Depth of field in this photo turns into death of field. I still like it</td>', 'Nice capture, my only wish was the top dock was also in focus , Depth of field in this photo turns into death of field. I still like it', '2004-02-23 11:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(594478, 61449, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of a shot from the Matrix challenge. Colouring is good, and puts the image into a non-mundane area, for sure. I''m not sure that you wouldn''t really want to make this a very symmetrical composition, given that it''s such a pure image, and simple picture: the slight tilt, and placing the pattern of the holes so far up frame works rather against the very abstract quality of it. Certainly meets challenge subject though.</td>', 'Reminiscent of a shot from the Matrix challenge. Colouring is good, and puts the image into a non-mundane area, for sure. I''m not sure that you wouldn''t really want to make this a very symmetrical composition, given that it''s such a pure image, and simple picture: the slight tilt, and placing the pattern of the holes so far up frame works rather against the very abstract quality of it. Certainly meets challenge subject though.', '2004-02-23 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(594491, 61700, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent abstract.  I think the horizontal shadow upsets the ''flow'' quite a bit though.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent abstract.  I think the horizontal shadow upsets the ''flow'' quite a bit though.', '2004-02-23 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(594509, 61751, 14620, '<td valign="top">Exellent Idea!  Great composition and wonderful colors. Great use of DOF also.  Fits challenge to a "T"!  Well done!  Should definetly be a Top 5, in my humble opinion. :-)</td>', 'Exellent Idea!  Great composition and wonderful colors. Great use of DOF also.  Fits challenge to a "T"!  Well done!  Should definetly be a Top 5, in my humble opinion. :-)', '2004-02-23 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(594510, 61759, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and very good composition.  Very cool!</td>', 'Wonderful colors and very good composition.  Very cool!', '2004-02-23 12:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(594513, 61557, 14620, '<td valign="top">So beautiful!  The textures in this shot are amazing and the composition is quite nice.</td>', 'So beautiful!  The textures in this shot are amazing and the composition is quite nice.', '2004-02-23 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(594514, 61230, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love this idea!  It''s so very simple and lovely at the same time.  Well done!</td>', 'I love this idea!  It''s so very simple and lovely at the same time.  Well done!', '2004-02-23 12:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(594516, 61770, 14620, '<td valign="top">What an interesting composition.  I really like the splash of blue in the background and also like your choice of border.</td>', 'What an interesting composition.  I really like the splash of blue in the background and also like your choice of border.', '2004-02-23 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(594522, 61645, 14620, '<td valign="top">Good composition and subject.  The colors are very nice, but something about the focus throws me off.  Seems to be a little soft.</td>', 'Good composition and subject.  The colors are very nice, but something about the focus throws me off.  Seems to be a little soft.', '2004-02-23 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(594526, 61830, 14620, '<td valign="top">A faster shutter speed may have helped a little here to bring more detail out in the waters movement.  Interesting composition.</td>', 'A faster shutter speed may have helped a little here to bring more detail out in the waters movement.  Interesting composition.', '2004-02-23 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(594527, 61853, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty shot.  I just wish there was a tab bit more light in the walkway to bring out a little more detail in the wood.  But overall, a nice composition.</td>', 'This is a very pretty shot.  I just wish there was a tab bit more light in the walkway to bring out a little more detail in the wood.  But overall, a nice composition.', '2004-02-23 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(594530, 61479, 14620, '<td valign="top">Well focused, but this just seems a little busy.  For some reason the colors of the cd and the leaves seem to really clash, also might try shooting the cd off to one side or the other and not place it in the center of the picture to add more interest.</td>', 'Well focused, but this just seems a little busy.  For some reason the colors of the cd and the leaves seem to really clash, also might try shooting the cd off to one side or the other and not place it in the center of the picture to add more interest.', '2004-02-23 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(594531, 61745, 14620, '<td valign="top">Ain''t that the truth, especially with kids and cats in the house, the perfect toilet paper roll is just an elusive dream....  I really like your idea and the composition is quite nice.  Kind of loses detail on the left side of the roll, but overall, very cool picture!</td>', 'Ain''t that the truth, especially with kids and cats in the house, the perfect toilet paper roll is just an elusive dream....  I really like your idea and the composition is quite nice.  Kind of loses detail on the left side of the roll, but overall, very cool picture!', '2004-02-23 12:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(594535, 61333, 14620, '<td valign="top">What a ghostly scene!  Like the lighting here very very much.  Very interesting composition.  Well done!</td>', 'What a ghostly scene!  Like the lighting here very very much.  Very interesting composition.  Well done!', '2004-02-23 12:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(594540, 60956, 14620, '<td valign="top">That is the cleanest ceiling fan I''ve EVER seen! :)  Excellent composition and great subject matter.  Very cool (no pun intended)</td>', 'That is the cleanest ceiling fan I''ve EVER seen! :)  Excellent composition and great subject matter.  Very cool (no pun intended)', '2004-02-23 12:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
