(594780, 61440, 7889, '<td valign="top">A ''cut'' above most entries in the challenge. Great colour. I would expect this to be highly placed.</td>', 'A ''cut'' above most entries in the challenge. Great colour. I would expect this to be highly placed.', '2004-02-23 15:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
