(594814, 60944, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice....nice....nice!   This is my idea of taking something mundane and ordinary and making it special.  It has that " wow" effect....I scored this a 10!</td>', 'nice....nice....nice!   This is my idea of taking something mundane and ordinary and making it special.  It has that " wow" effect....I scored this a 10!', '2004-02-23 16:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
