(594828, 61537, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition to this..Ilike the way the table reflection carries the blinds right down through the picture.   good work.</td>', 'Nice composition to this..Ilike the way the table reflection carries the blinds right down through the picture.   good work.', '2004-02-23 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
