(595348, 61689, 5007, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great photo, hope you will tell us how you did that.</td>', 'LOL! Great photo, hope you will tell us how you did that.', '2004-02-23 23:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(595352, 61843, 5007, '<td valign="top">One thing I think that would make this photo better is to shift the subject out of dead center. I like the color of the sky and clouds.</td>', 'One thing I think that would make this photo better is to shift the subject out of dead center. I like the color of the sky and clouds.', '2004-02-23 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(595354, 61853, 5007, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of the two subjects, the bridge and the snowy country scene. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of the two subjects, the bridge and the snowy country scene. I like it.', '2004-02-23 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(595356, 60897, 5007, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. You did an excellent job with the lighting. The thumbnail really showed the circle formed by the shadows. Well done, one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this shot. You did an excellent job with the lighting. The thumbnail really showed the circle formed by the shadows. Well done, one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-02-23 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(595357, 61814, 5007, '<td valign="top">I love the color and texture of the fence, makes me want to go peek through the peep holes too.</td>', 'I love the color and texture of the fence, makes me want to go peek through the peep holes too.', '2004-02-23 23:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(595359, 61711, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like the textures in this photo and the way you framed it. The red expired stands out and makes a statement.</td>', 'I like the textures in this photo and the way you framed it. The red expired stands out and makes a statement.', '2004-02-23 23:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(595360, 60944, 5007, '<td valign="top">Well done. Great colors and I like the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Well done. Great colors and I like the shallow depth of field.', '2004-02-23 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(595361, 61766, 5007, '<td valign="top">LOL!! This is a great shot and truly does look like an angel perched on the wine bottle. Well done, nice colors and good focus.</td>', 'LOL!! This is a great shot and truly does look like an angel perched on the wine bottle. Well done, nice colors and good focus.', '2004-02-23 23:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(595362, 61806, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice job composing this and using light to make it more interesting.</td>', 'Nice job composing this and using light to make it more interesting.', '2004-02-23 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(595364, 61493, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very original.</td>', 'Very original.', '2004-02-23 23:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(595376, 61550, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s a pretty fantastic capture.  Between the pieces of shell exploding and caught at the very edges of the frame and the hand in the lower left with the nutcracker making a nice dynamic line through the image, you''ve got the makings of a very well done shot here!</td>', 'Wow - that''s a pretty fantastic capture.  Between the pieces of shell exploding and caught at the very edges of the frame and the hand in the lower left with the nutcracker making a nice dynamic line through the image, you''ve got the makings of a very well done shot here!', '2004-02-23 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(595393, 61310, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, sure...  Go ahead and turn in a stunning shot like this for the mundane challenge...  :)  Really beautiful work.  I''ve tried and tried for years to find a spot like this to take a similar photo, and never have found it.  Congrats.  9</td>', 'Oh, sure...  Go ahead and turn in a stunning shot like this for the mundane challenge...  :)  Really beautiful work.  I''ve tried and tried for years to find a spot like this to take a similar photo, and never have found it.  Congrats.  9', '2004-02-23 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(595396, 61226, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - one of the most creative shots I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  Great saturated colors, very nice composition, and the texture created by all of those nails really makes it jump out at you.  Great shot!  9</td>', 'Wow - one of the most creative shots I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  Great saturated colors, very nice composition, and the texture created by all of those nails really makes it jump out at you.  Great shot!  9', '2004-02-23 23:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(595404, 61719, 5391, '<td valign="top">Fantastic visual effect.  Looking forward to reading technical data when the challenge is over.  Whatever this is, it''s very, very good.  10</td>', 'Fantastic visual effect.  Looking forward to reading technical data when the challenge is over.  Whatever this is, it''s very, very good.  10', '2004-02-23 23:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(595412, 61373, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is an exciting image.  You found a great creature.  HOpe you do well with this.  9</td>', 'This is an exciting image.  You found a great creature.  HOpe you do well with this.  9', '2004-02-23 23:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(595414, 60944, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is very exciting and an excellent use of color.  Unbelievably good seeing to find and interpret this one.  9</td>', 'This is very exciting and an excellent use of color.  Unbelievably good seeing to find and interpret this one.  9', '2004-02-23 23:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(595416, 61622, 14476, '<td valign="top">It used to be "just TP."  You''ve made it into an artform.  Good luck with this exciting image.  9</td>', 'It used to be "just TP."  You''ve made it into an artform.  Good luck with this exciting image.  9', '2004-02-23 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(595425, 61303, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I don''t get the title</td>', 'Nice shot, but I don''t get the title', '2004-02-23 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(595434, 61699, 13728, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I wonder two things...what if the white line was not there, or what if the shot were framed so th white line, went more from corner to corner.  I am not sure if either of these would have resulted in as nice a shot,..but I just wondered</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I wonder two things...what if the white line was not there, or what if the shot were framed so th white line, went more from corner to corner.  I am not sure if either of these would have resulted in as nice a shot,..but I just wondered', '2004-02-24 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(595438, 61592, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice idea...I was surprised not to see more on this variation.  Wish everyone else was a little blurier, showing more contrast in movement</td>', 'Nice idea...I was surprised not to see more on this variation.  Wish everyone else was a little blurier, showing more contrast in movement', '2004-02-24 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(595443, 61837, 10055, '<td valign="top">Very good job on the weave effect and making a flower more unmundane. However, I find the pollen stems not to be fit. They seem out of place. That just me. I like the color tones and shadeing too.</td>', 'Very good job on the weave effect and making a flower more unmundane. However, I find the pollen stems not to be fit. They seem out of place. That just me. I like the color tones and shadeing too.', '2004-02-24 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(595445, 61742, 16095, '<td valign="top">beautiful drugs!</td>', 'beautiful drugs!', '2004-02-24 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(595446, 61537, 16095, '<td valign="top">excellent comp</td>', 'excellent comp', '2004-02-24 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(595447, 61675, 10055, '<td valign="top">Neat shot....I''m guessing you will never loose your remote in the dark. :) I like it.</td>', 'Neat shot....I''m guessing you will never loose your remote in the dark. :) I like it.', '2004-02-24 00:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(595448, 61751, 16095, '<td valign="top">THIS IS A LOT OF WORK!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!great!!</td>', 'THIS IS A LOT OF WORK!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!great!!', '2004-02-24 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(595452, 61850, 16095, '<td valign="top">interesting subject choice</td>', 'interesting subject choice', '2004-02-24 00:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(595454, 61414, 16095, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-02-24 00:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(595456, 61555, 10055, '<td valign="top">Interresting. I like the glow concept. just perhaps off center it a bit. It needs something....a egg beater to go with it...</td>', 'Interresting. I like the glow concept. just perhaps off center it a bit. It needs something....a egg beater to go with it...', '2004-02-24 00:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(595457, 61209, 13728, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how mundane a butterfly is, but this is a very nice shot.  I ike the backgrund color</td>', 'I am not sure how mundane a butterfly is, but this is a very nice shot.  I ike the backgrund color', '2004-02-24 00:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(595458, 61829, 16095, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting technique</td>', 'interesting lighting technique', '2004-02-24 00:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(595459, 61831, 10055, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. how did you that?</td>', 'Cool shot. how did you that?', '2004-02-24 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(595460, 61835, 16095, '<td valign="top">this would be much easier on the eyes without the border</td>', 'this would be much easier on the eyes without the border', '2004-02-24 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(595462, 61570, 16095, '<td valign="top">these look dried?interesting</td>', 'these look dried?interesting', '2004-02-24 00:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(595463, 61840, 10055, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Perfect for my taste. It makes me feel like something is haunting me...</td>', 'Excellent shot! Perfect for my taste. It makes me feel like something is haunting me...', '2004-02-24 00:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(595464, 60944, 16095, '<td valign="top">really great</td>', 'really great', '2004-02-24 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(595467, 61622, 10055, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot you have here. I will never look upon a roll of tolet paper the same again. The lighting, shadeing, DOF and composition is outstanding. I give it a 10...</td>', 'Excellent shot you have here. I will never look upon a roll of tolet paper the same again. The lighting, shadeing, DOF and composition is outstanding. I give it a 10...', '2004-02-24 00:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(595468, 61837, 13728, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you are getting slammed for being too digital..But I like this shot and what you have done with it.  It certainly meets the challenge</td>', 'I wonder if you are getting slammed for being too digital..But I like this shot and what you have done with it.  It certainly meets the challenge', '2004-02-24 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(595469, 61758, 10055, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, great shot. However, to bad that some factory is out in the mountains somewhere poluting the air. I like it. Good job.</td>', 'Hmmm, great shot. However, to bad that some factory is out in the mountains somewhere poluting the air. I like it. Good job.', '2004-02-24 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(595471, 61788, 13728, '<td valign="top">This is probably worked in photoshop alot, but I like the effect, and hey, they changed the rules so you can do that</td>', 'This is probably worked in photoshop alot, but I like the effect, and hey, they changed the rules so you can do that', '2004-02-24 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(595472, 61750, 10055, '<td valign="top">I''ll just give you a 10 for such a mundane object...for real!  How about useing different lighting and use some shadows too...needs more something.</td>', 'I''ll just give you a 10 for such a mundane object...for real!  How about useing different lighting and use some shadows too...needs more something.', '2004-02-24 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(595474, 61741, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, simple but powerful. I like that the sky has a suble texture to contrast the smooth red umbrella. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, simple but powerful. I like that the sky has a suble texture to contrast the smooth red umbrella. Nice job.', '2004-02-24 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(595475, 61838, 10055, '<td valign="top">NOOOOOOOOO not Ron Jeremy and his pills again...I knew I went to bed early for some reason...mundane enough...</td>', 'NOOOOOOOOO not Ron Jeremy and his pills again...I knew I went to bed early for some reason...mundane enough...', '2004-02-24 00:20:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(595492, 60818, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like that this was converted to b/w, it''s more artistic and has more character to it. The lines that lead the eyes to the tilted top (which is also nice) and the gradient disappearance of the texture towards the bottom right made the composition very interesting. 9</td>', 'Very nice. I like that this was converted to b/w, it''s more artistic and has more character to it. The lines that lead the eyes to the tilted top (which is also nice) and the gradient disappearance of the texture towards the bottom right made the composition very interesting. 9', '2004-02-24 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(595493, 61706, 10055, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I really love this photo and would make a great print. However, as far as the theme goes, not sure that kids are really mundane things. Of course, I don''t have any kids (yet)....:) Great shot!</td>', 'Neat shot, I really love this photo and would make a great print. However, as far as the theme goes, not sure that kids are really mundane things. Of course, I don''t have any kids (yet)....:) Great shot!', '2004-02-24 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(595498, 60751, 10055, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice shot. I love it...simple, but has a mystry to it.</td>', 'Nice, very nice shot. I love it...simple, but has a mystry to it.', '2004-02-24 00:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(595564, 61604, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely colors. the grain and rings of the wood make it look almost like it''s flowing.</td>', 'lovely colors. the grain and rings of the wood make it look almost like it''s flowing.', '2004-02-24 01:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(595567, 61562, 17507, '<td valign="top">that is some excellent magnification.</td>', 'that is some excellent magnification.', '2004-02-24 01:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(595570, 61646, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely. the drop is so perfectly clear.</td>', 'lovely. the drop is so perfectly clear.', '2004-02-24 02:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(595571, 61731, 17507, '<td valign="top">how -ever- did you get that background. lovely monochrome work.</td>', 'how -ever- did you get that background. lovely monochrome work.', '2004-02-24 02:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(595572, 61474, 17507, '<td valign="top">tea in the garden?</td>', 'tea in the garden?', '2004-02-24 02:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(595573, 61700, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, that creates a really impressive visual static effect. nice work.</td>', 'wow, that creates a really impressive visual static effect. nice work.', '2004-02-24 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(595574, 61589, 17507, '<td valign="top">that is SO CUTE!!</td>', 'that is SO CUTE!!', '2004-02-24 02:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(595575, 61587, 17507, '<td valign="top">hahah! the toilet paper is FREE!</td>', 'hahah! the toilet paper is FREE!', '2004-02-24 02:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(595600, 61350, 245, '<td valign="top">I thnk the sun is a bit close to the corner, but those clouds are spectacular!</td>', 'I thnk the sun is a bit close to the corner, but those clouds are spectacular!', '2004-02-24 03:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(595602, 61807, 245, '<td valign="top">This is really sharp, I''m fond of abstract color.</td>', 'This is really sharp, I''m fond of abstract color.', '2004-02-24 03:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(595604, 61703, 245, '<td valign="top">Pull back a bit to show the edges, perhaps? They feel cramped to me, the frame is closing in.<br/></td>', 'Pull back a bit to show the edges, perhaps? They feel cramped to me, the frame is closing in.', '2004-02-24 03:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(595605, 61861, 245, '<td valign="top">This feels a bit oversharpened to me, and the table-cloth-like background, which would normally be flat if it were a tablelcoth, bends upwards... it''s disconcerting!<br/>Also, I would have eitehr cropped it tighter, or tried to capture a bit more in the frame, right now it''s in an ambivalent middle ground.</td>', 'This feels a bit oversharpened to me, and the table-cloth-like background, which would normally be flat if it were a tablelcoth, bends upwards... it''s disconcerting!Also, I would have eitehr cropped it tighter, or tried to capture a bit more in the frame, right now it''s in an ambivalent middle ground.', '2004-02-24 03:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(595606, 61829, 245, '<td valign="top">Cool! I like the strong backlighting and silhouette a lot. So many people love to shoot forks, eh?</td>', 'Cool! I like the strong backlighting and silhouette a lot. So many people love to shoot forks, eh?', '2004-02-24 03:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(595607, 61333, 245, '<td valign="top">Supernatural lighting, i like it! I would have tried moving the chair doen about 5%, though... the picture feels top heavy to me.</td>', 'Supernatural lighting, i like it! I would have tried moving the chair doen about 5%, though... the picture feels top heavy to me.', '2004-02-24 03:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(595608, 61761, 245, '<td valign="top">The whole image feels a little soft to me, but the exposure and color is nice.</td>', 'The whole image feels a little soft to me, but the exposure and color is nice.', '2004-02-24 03:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(595609, 61831, 245, '<td valign="top">A for effort! Did you light the bulb from below?</td>', 'A for effort! Did you light the bulb from below?', '2004-02-24 03:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(595610, 61414, 245, '<td valign="top">Finally a deep perspective DOF shot where  the area required to cover the entire frame is completely filled with the subject, even way in the back!</td>', 'Finally a deep perspective DOF shot where  the area required to cover the entire frame is completely filled with the subject, even way in the back!', '2004-02-24 03:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(595611, 61334, 245, '<td valign="top">While the face of the watch is sitting in a nice strong location, the watch as a whole doesn''t seem to sit comfortably in the frame. I would have tried placing the *entire* watch right int he middle. Nice, though!</td>', 'While the face of the watch is sitting in a nice strong location, the watch as a whole doesn''t seem to sit comfortably in the frame. I would have tried placing the *entire* watch right int he middle. Nice, though!', '2004-02-24 03:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(595612, 61771, 245, '<td valign="top">The shadows in the back are pretty distracting, I''d like to see the peas on an absolutely flat white background.</td>', 'The shadows in the back are pretty distracting, I''d like to see the peas on an absolutely flat white background.', '2004-02-24 03:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(595613, 61557, 245, '<td valign="top">The texture and contrast is excellent, but I find the framing a bit far to the left.</td>', 'The texture and contrast is excellent, but I find the framing a bit far to the left.', '2004-02-24 03:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(595614, 61562, 245, '<td valign="top">Cool theme! I like seeing the unground peppercorn too, nice macro.</td>', 'Cool theme! I like seeing the unground peppercorn too, nice macro.', '2004-02-24 03:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(595615, 61857, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice color!</td>', 'Nice color!', '2004-02-24 04:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(595618, 61645, 245, '<td valign="top">This really needs sharper focus to pop</td>', 'This really needs sharper focus to pop', '2004-02-24 04:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(595619, 61850, 245, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre juxtaposition!</td>', 'What a bizarre juxtaposition!', '2004-02-24 04:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(595621, 61377, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the positio of the neated funnel and bowls, but the background could be perfectly square. I like things with absolute vertical/horizontal lines.</td>', 'I like the positio of the neated funnel and bowls, but the background could be perfectly square. I like things with absolute vertical/horizontal lines.', '2004-02-24 04:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(595623, 61842, 245, '<td valign="top">Just the right amount of shne!</td>', 'Just the right amount of shne!', '2004-02-24 04:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(595624, 61834, 245, '<td valign="top">This is one of my faves, such soft lighting, and the DOF is perfect!</td>', 'This is one of my faves, such soft lighting, and the DOF is perfect!', '2004-02-24 04:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(595625, 61422, 245, '<td valign="top">Holy cow this is sharp!!! Nice!</td>', 'Holy cow this is sharp!!! Nice!', '2004-02-24 04:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(595626, 61496, 245, '<td valign="top">Typically i like shots like this a lot, but there''s something about the color and the darkness of the exposire that throws me off... it also seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Typically i like shots like this a lot, but there''s something about the color and the darkness of the exposire that throws me off... it also seems a bit soft.', '2004-02-24 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(595627, 61793, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice background to complement an interesting foreground!</td>', 'Nice background to complement an interesting foreground!', '2004-02-24 04:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(595632, 61831, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like a lot of things about this - the high contrast, grainy effect (actually comes from the background, I think), evenness of light in the ''un-lit'' bulbs, the slightly ''off'' composition. Has a near-graphic quality to it. Would personally have tried to get a more ''pnotographic'' progression of light across those bulbs, but that''s just a personal thing.</td>', 'Like a lot of things about this - the high contrast, grainy effect (actually comes from the background, I think), evenness of light in the ''un-lit'' bulbs, the slightly ''off'' composition. Has a near-graphic quality to it. Would personally have tried to get a more ''pnotographic'' progression of light across those bulbs, but that''s just a personal thing.', '2004-02-24 05:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(595633, 61730, 6999, '<td valign="top">What this lacks to my mind, is a moment of light. The illumination across the scene is absolutely even, very little graduation of shade anywhere: that leaves you without much evidence of texture to work with in your shot, and thus a mundane scene produces a mundane photograph. Compositionally the wooden thing really removes the eye from your subjects - without that the shaping of elements within the shot would be fine.</td>', 'What this lacks to my mind, is a moment of light. The illumination across the scene is absolutely even, very little graduation of shade anywhere: that leaves you without much evidence of texture to work with in your shot, and thus a mundane scene produces a mundane photograph. Compositionally the wooden thing really removes the eye from your subjects - without that the shaping of elements within the shot would be fine.', '2004-02-24 05:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(595635, 61789, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great moment to capture, fitting for the challenge. Final image lacks a level of detail at least however, which takes away quite a bit of the impact of the shot.</td>', 'Great moment to capture, fitting for the challenge. Final image lacks a level of detail at least however, which takes away quite a bit of the impact of the shot.', '2004-02-24 05:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(595636, 61743, 6999, '<td valign="top">fitting to the challenge, for sure. I guess people won''t like the photoshopping - though what bothers me more than the colouration os the shadows - they''re just too neat looking to be real.</td>', 'fitting to the challenge, for sure. I guess people won''t like the photoshopping - though what bothers me more than the colouration os the shadows - they''re just too neat looking to be real.', '2004-02-24 05:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(595637, 61701, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great light, great dof, very solid composition. like the graphic quality to this - and a full-on meeting of the challenge.</td>', 'Great light, great dof, very solid composition. like the graphic quality to this - and a full-on meeting of the challenge.', '2004-02-24 05:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(595654, 61840, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the B&amp;W and the full shadow - would like to see the full talon.</td>', 'like the B&W and the full shadow - would like to see the full talon.', '2004-02-24 07:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(595655, 61492, 14614, '<td valign="top">would have took me a whie to figure this one out.  Defineately improved the interest of this mundane item.  To make this a bit better: suggest a smaller width border (seems to draw my eye away vs. create a boundary) overall well done</td>', 'would have took me a whie to figure this one out.  Defineately improved the interest of this mundane item.  To make this a bit better: suggest a smaller width border (seems to draw my eye away vs. create a boundary) overall well done', '2004-02-24 07:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(595656, 61717, 14614, '<td valign="top">creative and excellent cropping.  I think a more interesting leaf would have helped raise my score a bit.</td>', 'creative and excellent cropping.  I think a more interesting leaf would have helped raise my score a bit.', '2004-02-24 07:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(595657, 61493, 14614, '<td valign="top">like that I can make out Orion''s belt - would have liked to see more stars. Dramatic composition and good use of negative space.  Chair seems a bit fuzzy?</td>', 'like that I can make out Orion''s belt - would have liked to see more stars. Dramatic composition and good use of negative space.  Chair seems a bit fuzzy?', '2004-02-24 07:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(595658, 60783, 14614, '<td valign="top">blue cast makes raises this from the mundane - would like to see it level and a more gradual fade (dark to light) from bottom to top.</td>', 'blue cast makes raises this from the mundane - would like to see it level and a more gradual fade (dark to light) from bottom to top.', '2004-02-24 07:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(595668, 61708, 16478, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a tiny bit out, but I guess that is inevitable on a shot like this. Otherwise a fantastic, very creative photo. 11 out of 10 for effort! Overall 9</td>', 'Focus seems a tiny bit out, but I guess that is inevitable on a shot like this. Otherwise a fantastic, very creative photo. 11 out of 10 for effort! Overall 9', '2004-02-24 07:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
