(595834, 61686, 5391, '<td valign="top">Such an amazing shot of such mundane objects!  This had to have been a "right place at the right time" kind of thing (unless you pushed those over yourself).  :)  Fantastic job of surveying the situation and finding a dramatic angle to really get a good composition.  I also just love the bright red of the phone boxes against the blander-colored background.  This is a ribbon-winner for me.  10</td>', 'Such an amazing shot of such mundane objects!  This had to have been a "right place at the right time" kind of thing (unless you pushed those over yourself).  :)  Fantastic job of surveying the situation and finding a dramatic angle to really get a good composition.  I also just love the bright red of the phone boxes against the blander-colored background.  This is a ribbon-winner for me.  10', '2004-02-24 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(595838, 61848, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - those dogs really catch some air!  Really made me smile.  Not a technically fantastic photograph, but it''s a 6 for good timing and emotional content.</td>', 'Wow - those dogs really catch some air!  Really made me smile.  Not a technically fantastic photograph, but it''s a 6 for good timing and emotional content.', '2004-02-24 09:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
