(595852, 61440, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - creative abstract with interesting composition.  I love that you haven''t lost any detail in the reds - so often you see reds that are so saturated that they have no form, shadow or texture to them, but this has a nice fluid feel throughout.  I love it!  8</td>', 'Wow - creative abstract with interesting composition.  I love that you haven''t lost any detail in the reds - so often you see reds that are so saturated that they have no form, shadow or texture to them, but this has a nice fluid feel throughout.  I love it!  8', '2004-02-24 10:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
