(596394, 61806, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very creative and intriguing use of lighting - I like the colours you''ve introduced here. And the repetitive shapes work well with that abstract feel.</td>', 'Very creative and intriguing use of lighting - I like the colours you''ve introduced here. And the repetitive shapes work well with that abstract feel.', '2004-02-24 16:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
