(596399, 61225, 14045, '<td valign="top">this one sparks my tasts buds and makes my mouth water. I now want to go to Burger King and get a apple pie.  I gave a 10 for the pic.</td>', 'this one sparks my tasts buds and makes my mouth water. I now want to go to Burger King and get a apple pie.  I gave a 10 for the pic.', '2004-02-24 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(596401, 61334, 14045, '<td valign="top">this would make a great advertisement.  10</td>', 'this would make a great advertisement.  10', '2004-02-24 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(596403, 61335, 2764, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect but the objects look odd - the horse appears to be half buried, the logs are distracting and the brown hollock in the middle is unattractive.  I like the scene in the background better, especially like the spot of sunlight.<br/></td>', 'Interesting effect but the objects look odd - the horse appears to be half buried, the logs are distracting and the brown hollock in the middle is unattractive.  I like the scene in the background better, especially like the spot of sunlight.', '2004-02-24 16:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(596405, 61686, 14045, '<td valign="top">I like this, did you push over the phone booths to get this shot.</td>', 'I like this, did you push over the phone booths to get this shot.', '2004-02-24 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(596407, 61737, 14045, '<td valign="top">nice puppy...... 10!</td>', 'nice puppy...... 10!', '2004-02-24 16:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(596410, 61562, 14045, '<td valign="top">very nice macro.</td>', 'very nice macro.', '2004-02-24 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(596413, 61711, 14045, '<td valign="top">this is a cool pic and after looking at it a second time I''m bumping you up a point.</td>', 'this is a cool pic and after looking at it a second time I''m bumping you up a point.', '2004-02-24 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(596417, 61689, 14045, '<td valign="top">Its gona hurt when you come down..</td>', 'Its gona hurt when you come down..', '2004-02-24 16:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(596418, 61730, 2764, '<td valign="top">um - you got the mundane part but didn''t do a very good job of making it interesting. all your leading lines lead right out of the picture frame and that makes the viewer think "next photo" without coming back for a second glance.</td>', 'um - you got the mundane part but didn''t do a very good job of making it interesting. all your leading lines lead right out of the picture frame and that makes the viewer think "next photo" without coming back for a second glance.', '2004-02-24 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(596419, 61666, 14045, '<td valign="top">this one is a cool pic. I like the shirts.</td>', 'this one is a cool pic. I like the shirts.', '2004-02-24 16:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(596421, 61706, 14045, '<td valign="top">he looks like hes off to work.</td>', 'he looks like hes off to work.', '2004-02-24 16:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(596423, 61789, 14045, '<td valign="top">good capture</td>', 'good capture', '2004-02-24 16:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(596428, 60944, 3087, '<td valign="top">The colours in this just reach out and grab me and I love the way this really uses the whole frame so well. I like your choice to focus on the head of the handle and throw the two nearest spokes out of focus. Lighting is also just right.</td>', 'The colours in this just reach out and grab me and I love the way this really uses the whole frame so well. I like your choice to focus on the head of the handle and throw the two nearest spokes out of focus. Lighting is also just right.', '2004-02-24 16:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(596429, 61550, 9941, '<td valign="top">One of the more clever entries in this challenge. 9.</td>', 'One of the more clever entries in this challenge. 9.', '2004-02-24 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(596434, 61592, 2764, '<td valign="top">okay - I''m done voting and this photo is far and away the best!  this is a wonderful image!  Yep she sure looks bored and that is emphasized by the busyness of every one else.  even the still face in the mirror is critical of her.  The lines in the floor are great, leads you into the room.  The B &amp; W tones are perfect.  She is so contrasty, so is the room but the other people are muted with motion blur.  I love it!  10</td>', 'okay - I''m done voting and this photo is far and away the best!  this is a wonderful image!  Yep she sure looks bored and that is emphasized by the busyness of every one else.  even the still face in the mirror is critical of her.  The lines in the floor are great, leads you into the room.  The B & W tones are perfect.  She is so contrasty, so is the room but the other people are muted with motion blur.  I love it!  10', '2004-02-24 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(596438, 61743, 17530, '<td valign="top">The shadows really make this shot a winner   10</td>', 'The shadows really make this shot a winner   10', '2004-02-24 16:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(596446, 61789, 10680, '<td valign="top">nice capture. love duck shots!</td>', 'nice capture. love duck shots!', '2004-02-24 16:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(596455, 61310, 10680, '<td valign="top">could''ve used probably a tiny bit more exposure. looks great though!</td>', 'could''ve used probably a tiny bit more exposure. looks great though!', '2004-02-24 16:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(596461, 61678, 10680, '<td valign="top">go Fuji! :)</td>', 'go Fuji! :)', '2004-02-24 16:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(596464, 61429, 10680, '<td valign="top">could use a bit more light on the inside of the flower. looks good though.</td>', 'could use a bit more light on the inside of the flower. looks good though.', '2004-02-24 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(596468, 61761, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a great macro and I love the focus on something I wouldn''t normally look closely at. The colours also work well. I''d prefer the horizontal wire to be more accurately horizontal in the frame and the cylinder around which it''s wrapped to be more accurately vertical - I keep tilting my head subconsciously when I view this... But I like it very much.</td>', 'This is a great macro and I love the focus on something I wouldn''t normally look closely at. The colours also work well. I''d prefer the horizontal wire to be more accurately horizontal in the frame and the cylinder around which it''s wrapped to be more accurately vertical - I keep tilting my head subconsciously when I view this... But I like it very much.', '2004-02-24 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(596469, 61706, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I could ever think of a beautiful young boy as mundane so, for me, it''s not a good fit to the challenge theme, but I do like the image. I like the shadows and the high contrast adds interest.</td>', 'I''m not sure I could ever think of a beautiful young boy as mundane so, for me, it''s not a good fit to the challenge theme, but I do like the image. I like the shadows and the high contrast adds interest.', '2004-02-24 16:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(596470, 61493, 3087, '<td valign="top">Much coolness. What a view.</td>', 'Much coolness. What a view.', '2004-02-24 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(596472, 61209, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I could ever see a beautiful butterfly as mundane but this is a stunning shot, well chosen background, well composed image, it''s so unusual to see a nature shot that is so modern and clean. Very striking.</td>', 'I''m not sure I could ever see a beautiful butterfly as mundane but this is a stunning shot, well chosen background, well composed image, it''s so unusual to see a nature shot that is so modern and clean. Very striking.', '2004-02-24 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(596474, 61708, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very cool - lighting a touch harsh - fascinating subject.</td>', 'Very cool - lighting a touch harsh - fascinating subject.', '2004-02-24 17:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(596478, 61604, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s incredible! Great textures and the way the wood is almost black and white works so well against that rich rusty red. This really is wonderful!</td>', 'Wow! That''s incredible! Great textures and the way the wood is almost black and white works so well against that rich rusty red. This really is wonderful!', '2004-02-24 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(596480, 61856, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice curved line from corner down to foreground - gives a strong composition. Like low DOF (but then I''m a big fan of shallow DOF images more often than not) and black and white works well.</td>', 'Nice curved line from corner down to foreground - gives a strong composition. Like low DOF (but then I''m a big fan of shallow DOF images more often than not) and black and white works well.', '2004-02-24 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(596482, 61703, 3087, '<td valign="top">That texture and detail is pulling me in and I like the two colour split background very much.</td>', 'That texture and detail is pulling me in and I like the two colour split background very much.', '2004-02-24 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(596483, 61758, 16685, '<td valign="top">absolutely wonderful. Almost fits into the elements challenge. Good luck</td>', 'absolutely wonderful. Almost fits into the elements challenge. Good luck', '2004-02-24 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(596485, 61492, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very striking - I can look at it with different scales - a hairbrush - a toaster size mystery machine, a strange piece of modern architecture... most cool. I think I''d convert to black and white to lose that purple tinge on the base but you may have wanted that edge of colour.</td>', 'This is very striking - I can look at it with different scales - a hairbrush - a toaster size mystery machine, a strange piece of modern architecture... most cool. I think I''d convert to black and white to lose that purple tinge on the base but you may have wanted that edge of colour.', '2004-02-24 17:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(596487, 61560, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a great focal point and I like the way you have repetition/ symmetry in the image from the trees and then the asymmetrical from the lone cyclist. Good choice to include huge expanse of empty sky.</td>', 'What a great focal point and I like the way you have repetition/ symmetry in the image from the trees and then the asymmetrical from the lone cyclist. Good choice to include huge expanse of empty sky.', '2004-02-24 17:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(596491, 61310, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fairytale scene - I like how two foreground branches seem to cross and form an arch.</td>', 'Fairytale scene - I like how two foreground branches seem to cross and form an arch.', '2004-02-24 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(596493, 61350, 3087, '<td valign="top">I guess sunsets are something that can be mundane, in the sense that we sometimes take their beauty for granted and stop looking - but this one is beautiful.</td>', 'I guess sunsets are something that can be mundane, in the sense that we sometimes take their beauty for granted and stop looking - but this one is beautiful.', '2004-02-24 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(596494, 61734, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition - the positioning of the pointers within the frame, their angle, the curved sweep of the edging pattern, the hard border of the wood - excellent.</td>', 'Very strong composition - the positioning of the pointers within the frame, their angle, the curved sweep of the edging pattern, the hard border of the wood - excellent.', '2004-02-24 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(596495, 61587, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good choice of roll - the textured pattern adds necessary detail. I have this wonderful image of a photographer throwing loo rolls around and strangers just looking on in surprise and thinking about calling the men in white coats! :)</td>', 'Good choice of roll - the textured pattern adds necessary detail. I have this wonderful image of a photographer throwing loo rolls around and strangers just looking on in surprise and thinking about calling the men in white coats! :)', '2004-02-24 17:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(596496, 61645, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great point of view and crop, love the fill-frame. However, it seems a bit out of focus or not sharp enough, I think the wings are supposed to, and they should be IMHO, but the eye and beak could look a bit sharper. All in this is a great shot and should finish up amongst the highest ones. 8</td>', 'Great point of view and crop, love the fill-frame. However, it seems a bit out of focus or not sharp enough, I think the wings are supposed to, and they should be IMHO, but the eye and beak could look a bit sharper. All in this is a great shot and should finish up amongst the highest ones. 8', '2004-02-24 17:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(596498, 61748, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love black and white images that are so strongly about shape and about light and shadow. Nice use of the shadow itself as part of the composition. Lighting is intriguing - I like the light foreground and darker background. The texture of the surface is interesting too.</td>', 'I love black and white images that are so strongly about shape and about light and shadow. Nice use of the shadow itself as part of the composition. Lighting is intriguing - I like the light foreground and darker background. The texture of the surface is interesting too.', '2004-02-24 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(596499, 61814, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and I like the way you''ve included two vertical gaps - makes for good composition plus gives us a little more of the background than the two holes. Very interesting and great colours and textures.</td>', 'Beautiful and I like the way you''ve included two vertical gaps - makes for good composition plus gives us a little more of the background than the two holes. Very interesting and great colours and textures.', '2004-02-24 17:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(596500, 61751, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is great! Composition is great - sweep of line and position of ball work well. Colours are just so zingy! Very quirky and hence very cool!</td>', 'This is great! Composition is great - sweep of line and position of ball work well. Colours are just so zingy! Very quirky and hence very cool!', '2004-02-24 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(596501, 60897, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like how the line of the shadows blends to the point that it makes a very smooth curved line. Strong abstract by use of shapes and light and shadow and the high contrast works well.</td>', 'I like how the line of the shadows blends to the point that it makes a very smooth curved line. Strong abstract by use of shapes and light and shadow and the high contrast works well.', '2004-02-24 17:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(596502, 61719, 8722, '<td valign="top">Abso-frigin-lutely amazing</td>', 'Abso-frigin-lutely amazing', '2004-02-24 17:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(596504, 61861, 489, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - the color of the strawberries is perfect. Good DOF control as well.</td>', 'Nicely done - the color of the strawberries is perfect. Good DOF control as well.', '2004-02-24 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(596505, 61809, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the elliptical light - and the way the fork merges with the black surround.</td>', 'Love the elliptical light - and the way the fork merges with the black surround.', '2004-02-24 17:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(596507, 61711, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - good contrast of color and monochrome. I like that the offset of the meter.</td>', 'Nice shot - good contrast of color and monochrome. I like that the offset of the meter.', '2004-02-24 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(596508, 61700, 3087, '<td valign="top">Can''t "see" what this is - can''t resolve it - but I love the abstract nature and contour lines of light and shadow. That strong horizontal towards the top really anchors the rest of it.</td>', 'Can''t "see" what this is - can''t resolve it - but I love the abstract nature and contour lines of light and shadow. That strong horizontal towards the top really anchors the rest of it.', '2004-02-24 17:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(596509, 61678, 489, '<td valign="top">It''s an OK shot - I guess the main thing is I am left wanting a little bit more from it.</td>', 'It''s an OK shot - I guess the main thing is I am left wanting a little bit more from it.', '2004-02-24 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(596511, 61699, 489, '<td valign="top">I like it - neat color.</td>', 'I like it - neat color.', '2004-02-24 17:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(596512, 61209, 16478, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t class a butterfly as mundane. Nice shot but doesn''t really fit the challenge</td>', 'I wouldn''t class a butterfly as mundane. Nice shot but doesn''t really fit the challenge', '2004-02-24 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(596513, 61518, 3087, '<td valign="top">That light is just golden. I like the angle of the nib and the low DOF throwing out the cap behind it. The background blends well with the golden nib without losing definition of the shape of the nib.</td>', 'That light is just golden. I like the angle of the nib and the low DOF throwing out the cap behind it. The background blends well with the golden nib without losing definition of the shape of the nib.', '2004-02-24 17:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(596515, 61731, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, great background - love that "cloud" feel. "X" composition of wires works well as does shallow DOF. Interesting texture on the wire itself - like old paint that''s worn off.</td>', 'Nice colours, great background - love that "cloud" feel. "X" composition of wires works well as does shallow DOF. Interesting texture on the wire itself - like old paint that''s worn off.', '2004-02-24 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(596516, 61719, 7543, '<td valign="top">Have no idea what this is, but it looks great!</td>', 'Have no idea what this is, but it looks great!', '2004-02-24 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(596519, 61740, 489, '<td valign="top">Good shot - I can''t imagine getting a much sharper shot either. Great clarity.</td>', 'Good shot - I can''t imagine getting a much sharper shot either. Great clarity.', '2004-02-24 17:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(596520, 61717, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice approach, looks good and genuine. Good job</td>', 'Nice approach, looks good and genuine. Good job', '2004-02-24 17:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(596521, 61731, 16004, '<td valign="top">stunning picture.  10.  easy.  totally deserves a ribbon.  I think it''s my favourite this week.  gorgeous.</td>', 'stunning picture.  10.  easy.  totally deserves a ribbon.  I think it''s my favourite this week.  gorgeous.', '2004-02-24 17:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(596523, 61745, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good title. Contrast between the paper and background could be higher (middle of the picture), good over all.</td>', 'Good idea, good title. Contrast between the paper and background could be higher (middle of the picture), good over all.', '2004-02-24 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(596524, 61679, 489, '<td valign="top">Original concept. Good job of meeting the theme head-on.</td>', 'Original concept. Good job of meeting the theme head-on.', '2004-02-24 17:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(596525, 61351, 489, '<td valign="top">Dim. I think this would have benefited from some more light.</td>', 'Dim. I think this would have benefited from some more light.', '2004-02-24 17:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(596526, 61766, 17294, '<td valign="top">Great idea, fits perfectly in this contest.</td>', 'Great idea, fits perfectly in this contest.', '2004-02-24 17:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(596527, 61646, 16004, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on an old favourite - droplet convincingly looking like mercury.  Can''t work out how much the picture has been rotated, indeed, if it has at all.  The bottom left is a bit too distracting - loses some of the purity you have in the foreground and background.  like it lots.  9.</td>', 'Interesting take on an old favourite - droplet convincingly looking like mercury.  Can''t work out how much the picture has been rotated, indeed, if it has at all.  The bottom left is a bit too distracting - loses some of the purity you have in the foreground and background.  like it lots.  9.', '2004-02-24 17:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(596529, 61696, 7543, '<td valign="top">Technically superb! Good idea as well. Good job!</td>', 'Technically superb! Good idea as well. Good job!', '2004-02-24 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(596530, 61859, 16004, '<td valign="top">Sheet of paper?  That IS mundane!  Did you specifically try to go for the most unexciting object ever?  You''re very brave - pays off quite well too!  Might be a little more striking if it had been a bit squarer (bottom right specifically).  Still, surprisingly impressed given the subject matter.  8!</td>', 'Sheet of paper?  That IS mundane!  Did you specifically try to go for the most unexciting object ever?  You''re very brave - pays off quite well too!  Might be a little more striking if it had been a bit squarer (bottom right specifically).  Still, surprisingly impressed given the subject matter.  8!', '2004-02-24 17:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(596568, 61303, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um, no offense, but if these are your dishes, I''ll probably turn down an invitation to dinner... :)</td>', 'Um, no offense, but if these are your dishes, I''ll probably turn down an invitation to dinner... :)', '2004-02-24 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(596597, 61730, 327, '<td valign="top">Technically you''ve done a good job with this shot. The greens are good. It falls short in the composition. We really don''t see much of the clay pot and the white rock is the most dominate object seen. The red post is old and faded as only serves to cut the picture in half. Does that sound harsh? I hope not, just my feeling.</td>', 'Technically you''ve done a good job with this shot. The greens are good. It falls short in the composition. We really don''t see much of the clay pot and the white rock is the most dominate object seen. The red post is old and faded as only serves to cut the picture in half. Does that sound harsh? I hope not, just my feeling.', '2004-02-24 18:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(596598, 61059, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the object is in the background. &lt;?&gt; I  think for the most part this is out of focus and so lacks in zip/wow/ or punch along with the muted coloring.</td>', 'Not sure what the object is in the background. <?> I  think for the most part this is out of focus and so lacks in zip/wow/ or punch along with the muted coloring.', '2004-02-24 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(596601, 61860, 327, '<td valign="top">The tones, light and focus couldn''t be much better. I don''t like the composition. So much going on and his foot is a hat. I think the crop and the (interest) is him and the fiddle. ?Maybe from the waist up would of been plenty. :) Good luck in the challenge. P.S. sweet lens you have there.</td>', 'The tones, light and focus couldn''t be much better. I don''t like the composition. So much going on and his foot is a hat. I think the crop and the (interest) is him and the fiddle. ?Maybe from the waist up would of been plenty. :) Good luck in the challenge. P.S. sweet lens you have there.', '2004-02-24 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(596602, 61379, 327, '<td valign="top">Are those hair crunchies? LOL Cute.</td>', 'Are those hair crunchies? LOL Cute.', '2004-02-24 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(596603, 61701, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good idea, cool effect. Maybe a reflector card or something would do to light up the left side if you like that. Like this shot, different</td>', 'Good idea, cool effect. Maybe a reflector card or something would do to light up the left side if you like that. Like this shot, different', '2004-02-24 18:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(596605, 61857, 327, '<td valign="top">Like this shot, love the focus and colors. Nicely done.</td>', 'Like this shot, love the focus and colors. Nicely done.', '2004-02-24 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(596606, 60944, 327, '<td valign="top">Yummy colors, focus and light. Really fits the challenge......good going!.</td>', 'Yummy colors, focus and light. Really fits the challenge......good going!.', '2004-02-24 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(596607, 61795, 7543, '<td valign="top">One shot in this challenge has a similar subject, drinking straws. I must say that I like the other one better than this one, although this one is good. There is however a bit of distortion, or fuzziness that doesnt do it well.</td>', 'One shot in this challenge has a similar subject, drinking straws. I must say that I like the other one better than this one, although this one is good. There is however a bit of distortion, or fuzziness that doesnt do it well.', '2004-02-24 18:56:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(596609, 61751, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice one... 10 from me... Dooo can''t wote.... sowy.</td>', 'Nice one... 10 from me... Dooo can''t wote.... sowy.', '2004-02-24 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(596612, 61849, 7543, '<td valign="top">Not the most original subject, but the execution of the idea is great! Looks like the lighting is natural, I would think this would be a top of a car and sunlight? Great colors, and "swirling" effect on the row. Good!</td>', 'Not the most original subject, but the execution of the idea is great! Looks like the lighting is natural, I would think this would be a top of a car and sunlight? Great colors, and "swirling" effect on the row. Good!', '2004-02-24 18:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(596614, 61854, 7543, '<td valign="top">Forks are getting very popular. Good B&amp;W, DOF great and good texture as well. Very nice shot!</td>', 'Forks are getting very popular. Good B&W, DOF great and good texture as well. Very nice shot!', '2004-02-24 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(596637, 61373, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very effective interpretation.</td>', 'Very effective interpretation.', '2004-02-24 19:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(596638, 60897, 16957, '<td valign="top">An elegant interpretation of the chalenge</td>', 'An elegant interpretation of the chalenge', '2004-02-24 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(596639, 61465, 16957, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautifully toned.</td>', 'Simple and beautifully toned.', '2004-02-24 19:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(596641, 61095, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting effect, and great composition. Nice work.</td>', 'Very cool lighting effect, and great composition. Nice work.', '2004-02-24 19:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(596642, 61496, 16957, '<td valign="top">Effective composition and observation of colour. Certainly makes the mundane interesting.</td>', 'Effective composition and observation of colour. Certainly makes the mundane interesting.', '2004-02-24 19:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(596643, 61429, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured.</td>', 'Very nicely captured.', '2004-02-24 19:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(596644, 61590, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very effective challenge entry</td>', 'Very effective challenge entry', '2004-02-24 19:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(596646, 61735, 16957, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Well done for taking the time.</td>', 'Excellent. Well done for taking the time.', '2004-02-24 19:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(596647, 61560, 16957, '<td valign="top">I like the observation, the framing and the composition. Lovely shot.</td>', 'I like the observation, the framing and the composition. Lovely shot.', '2004-02-24 19:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
