(596752, 61303, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m at a loss to understand the title.  Other than that, it''s not a bad picture with sort of an interesting, intimate, early-morning feel to it.  I like it.  Good capture of mood.  7</td>', 'I''m at a loss to understand the title.  Other than that, it''s not a bad picture with sort of an interesting, intimate, early-morning feel to it.  I like it.  Good capture of mood.  7', '2004-02-24 21:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(596755, 61587, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the roll in flight. you''ve captured a nice moment with a good "tail". the shot is somewhat noisy however and I think it might have benefitted from lighting it at a different angle.</td>', 'I like the idea of the roll in flight. you''ve captured a nice moment with a good "tail". the shot is somewhat noisy however and I think it might have benefitted from lighting it at a different angle.', '2004-02-24 21:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(596757, 61377, 8624, '<td valign="top">the glow of the plastic is interesting and I like how you moved the handles around for visual contrast. I think you could have positioned the  inner bowl to be more centered. Also, it looks like some bad blurring work on the bottom coaster.</td>', 'the glow of the plastic is interesting and I like how you moved the handles around for visual contrast. I think you could have positioned the  inner bowl to be more centered. Also, it looks like some bad blurring work on the bottom coaster.', '2004-02-24 21:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(596759, 61652, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute idea. reminds me of the "Hardware Wars" parody movie.</td>', 'cute idea. reminds me of the "Hardware Wars" parody movie.', '2004-02-24 21:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
