(596765, 61829, 8624, '<td valign="top">good idea but the details of the fly are completely lost in shadow. you may have intended the silouette effect but I think it just presents a dark blobby spot in the middle of the frame. I do like the details in the fork tines, though.</td>', 'good idea but the details of the fly are completely lost in shadow. you may have intended the silouette effect but I think it just presents a dark blobby spot in the middle of the frame. I do like the details in the fork tines, though.', '2004-02-24 21:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(596768, 61837, 8624, '<td valign="top">interested digital art effect. I expect you''ll get hammered by the photography purists. I like the image but have to admit that the impact of the shot comes from your special effects not from presenting a mundane subject in and of itself in an interesting way.</td>', 'interested digital art effect. I expect you''ll get hammered by the photography purists. I like the image but have to admit that the impact of the shot comes from your special effects not from presenting a mundane subject in and of itself in an interesting way.', '2004-02-24 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
