(596775, 61562, 8624, '<td valign="top">wow. I''m sneezing just looking at the giant peppercorn. good texture study and nice job making an everyday object look very interesting</td>', 'wow. I''m sneezing just looking at the giant peppercorn. good texture study and nice job making an everyday object look very interesting', '2004-02-24 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(596776, 61859, 8624, '<td valign="top">has a nice pop art feel to it. the fact that the paper is somewhat curled at the edges provides some visual interest to what would otherwise be a simple rectangle on a black field. I also like the color variation across the paper. maybe some people who are marking this down don''t see the beauty in simplicity?</td>', 'has a nice pop art feel to it. the fact that the paper is somewhat curled at the edges provides some visual interest to what would otherwise be a simple rectangle on a black field. I also like the color variation across the paper. maybe some people who are marking this down don''t see the beauty in simplicity?', '2004-02-24 21:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(596819, 61765, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is a fantastic shot, however there is nothing mundane about it-it is fabulous.  So I am torn how to vore....</td>', 'That is a fantastic shot, however there is nothing mundane about it-it is fabulous.  So I am torn how to vore....', '2004-02-24 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
