(596992, 61807, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of filters. I have used Photoshop since version 4. Here for this site and this challenge I think your a little too heavy handed. The integrity of the photo is lost. I do realize these are the copper finished windows often seen in cities, but along with the blue and the light I don''t think it works. Sorry, don''t mean to sound harsh.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of filters. I have used Photoshop since version 4. Here for this site and this challenge I think your a little too heavy handed. The integrity of the photo is lost. I do realize these are the copper finished windows often seen in cities, but along with the blue and the light I don''t think it works. Sorry, don''t mean to sound harsh.', '2004-02-24 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(597175, 61652, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love how you took everyday ink jet cartridges and made them into spaceships. I would have cropped the left side more so the motion blur would come directly out of the side of the frame. 9</td>', 'This is great! I love how you took everyday ink jet cartridges and made them into spaceships. I would have cropped the left side more so the motion blur would come directly out of the side of the frame. 9', '2004-02-25 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(597179, 61796, 8054, '<td valign="top">The left and right profile images lack contrast and depth. Very creative idea, though!</td>', 'The left and right profile images lack contrast and depth. Very creative idea, though!', '2004-02-25 01:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(597185, 61631, 8054, '<td valign="top">I can make out 1 of 2 items in this image and one is ice. Not sure what the other things is. I wish I knew what it was so I could score this higher. Based on the ice alone, it is a very good shot. Excellent details on the ice surface and realistic color.</td>', 'I can make out 1 of 2 items in this image and one is ice. Not sure what the other things is. I wish I knew what it was so I could score this higher. Based on the ice alone, it is a very good shot. Excellent details on the ice surface and realistic color.', '2004-02-25 01:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(597187, 61771, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good color and textures of the peas. Lighting seems to be bright. It works ok in this shot but I would have preferred softer lighting for a shot like ths (macro). Also, I think the shadows in the backgroud (near the top) are distracting. Looks like you added noise to the image and it looks good. 7</td>', 'Good color and textures of the peas. Lighting seems to be bright. It works ok in this shot but I would have preferred softer lighting for a shot like ths (macro). Also, I think the shadows in the backgroud (near the top) are distracting. Looks like you added noise to the image and it looks good. 7', '2004-02-25 01:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(597190, 61562, 8054, '<td valign="top">Cropping could use some work (and maybe composure). The left side is not even with the right side. I mean that the distance from the left edge of the pepper and the right side to the edge are not the same. And for the upper left corner, if the dark spot was not there it would have better balance.</td>', 'Cropping could use some work (and maybe composure). The left side is not even with the right side. I mean that the distance from the left edge of the pepper and the right side to the edge are not the same. And for the upper left corner, if the dark spot was not there it would have better balance.', '2004-02-25 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(597192, 60733, 8054, '<td valign="top">The plate seems to be overexposed. This was a tough shot or maybe it''s the bright illumination that is making it tough to capture the plate. Might have been better without it. I also do not see any teabags or other suggestions that actual tea is supposed to be in the cup.</td>', 'The plate seems to be overexposed. This was a tough shot or maybe it''s the bright illumination that is making it tough to capture the plate. Might have been better without it. I also do not see any teabags or other suggestions that actual tea is supposed to be in the cup.', '2004-02-25 01:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(597194, 61734, 8054, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the hands of a clock. Those are things I take for granted everyday that''s for sure. Nice DOF and application of noise. 7</td>', 'Ahh, the hands of a clock. Those are things I take for granted everyday that''s for sure. Nice DOF and application of noise. 7', '2004-02-25 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
