(597807, 61458, 489, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I would love to see the same shot with only one of the containers holding a different color bean instead of two - sort of a "Standing out from the crowd" theme. Fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Great shot. I would love to see the same shot with only one of the containers holding a different color bean instead of two - sort of a "Standing out from the crowd" theme. Fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-25 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
