(599105, 61837, 8953, '<td valign="top">No doubt a lot of effort went into this...a seven for that but your subject is anything but mundane. A wonderful flower just the same:)</td>', 'No doubt a lot of effort went into this...a seven for that but your subject is anything but mundane. A wonderful flower just the same:)', '2004-02-25 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(599252, 61858, 9906, '<td valign="top">There is not a lot inthis photo that is truly mundane IMHO.  Not to say that it''s not a good shot of a guy on a bike doing crazy things, but in MY definition, that precludes the challenge theme...<br/>TC<br/>PS.  Can''t wait to see camera settings on this one as ya did a damn good job of capturing the guy on the bike!</td>', 'There is not a lot inthis photo that is truly mundane IMHO.  Not to say that it''s not a good shot of a guy on a bike doing crazy things, but in MY definition, that precludes the challenge theme...TCPS.  Can''t wait to see camera settings on this one as ya did a damn good job of capturing the guy on the bike!', '2004-02-26 00:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(599254, 61837, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot goes way beyond photographic integrity!<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot goes way beyond photographic integrity!TC', '2004-02-26 00:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(599258, 61750, 9906, '<td valign="top">OK.... let''s go by your title,  ''A New Species'', this would imply that this is NOT mundane and therefore would not meet the challenge.  From a photographic standpoint,  it''s a touch hard to look at and looks over photoshopped, however, it could just be that you used an on board flash and it made the shot look funny...<br/>TC</td>', 'OK.... let''s go by your title,  ''A New Species'', this would imply that this is NOT mundane and therefore would not meet the challenge.  From a photographic standpoint,  it''s a touch hard to look at and looks over photoshopped, however, it could just be that you used an on board flash and it made the shot look funny...TC', '2004-02-26 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(599261, 61688, 9906, '<td valign="top">Unless you actually painted your hands, IMHO this has gone beyond the point of photograhic intregrity and I can''t rightly vote it very high...<br/>TC</td>', 'Unless you actually painted your hands, IMHO this has gone beyond the point of photograhic intregrity and I can''t rightly vote it very high...TC', '2004-02-26 00:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(599264, 61740, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overly sharp, but nice detail!  I am curious as to which country this money belongs to.<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks a little overly sharp, but nice detail!  I am curious as to which country this money belongs to.TC', '2004-02-26 00:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
