(599269, 61838, 8891, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.....I just don''t see where this is other than still mundane....I will assume that you are pro-mundane and anti-extraordinary.</td>', 'Hmmmm.....I just don''t see where this is other than still mundane....I will assume that you are pro-mundane and anti-extraordinary.', '2004-02-26 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
