(599273, 61717, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition. I like the contrast in coloring.</td>', 'Nice shot and composition. I like the contrast in coloring.', '2004-02-26 00:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(599274, 61740, 15305, '<td valign="top">Incredible macro shot, nice and shiny.</td>', 'Incredible macro shot, nice and shiny.', '2004-02-26 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(599276, 61303, 8891, '<td valign="top">If this is self portraiture, of sorts, then I understand the focal problems of the the finer and the razor. the act is mundane and at least an attempt to make it look extradordinary was made.  BW was a good choice. Don''t get the title at all except for it also being mundane.</td>', 'If this is self portraiture, of sorts, then I understand the focal problems of the the finer and the razor. the act is mundane and at least an attempt to make it look extradordinary was made.  BW was a good choice. Don''t get the title at all except for it also being mundane.', '2004-02-26 00:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(599278, 61570, 15305, '<td valign="top">Scary, I think I''ll never eat fish in the rest of my life!!!  Interesting POV. Composition can be improved though.</td>', 'Scary, I think I''ll never eat fish in the rest of my life!!!  Interesting POV. Composition can be improved though.', '2004-02-26 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(599279, 61853, 9906, '<td valign="top">I cringe at the thought of trying to take a shot like this with my simple point and shoot.  I also sympathize for all the ''it''s too dark'' comments that you''ll probably get.  I love this shot.  It''s a touch too soft for my taste, but you get bonus points for seeing this and thinking if you can pull it off.  it''s an awesome attempt.  Kudos on a near miss.<br/>TC<br/></td>', 'I cringe at the thought of trying to take a shot like this with my simple point and shoot.  I also sympathize for all the ''it''s too dark'' comments that you''ll probably get.  I love this shot.  It''s a touch too soft for my taste, but you get bonus points for seeing this and thinking if you can pull it off.  it''s an awesome attempt.  Kudos on a near miss.TC', '2004-02-26 01:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(599280, 61493, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice composition.', '2004-02-26 01:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(599281, 61228, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great lighting. A different POV could improve the composition.</td>', 'Nice shot, great lighting. A different POV could improve the composition.', '2004-02-26 01:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(599282, 61771, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little oversharp for my taste!  Interesting composition, but not a terribly interesting subject.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little oversharp for my taste!  Interesting composition, but not a terribly interesting subject.TC', '2004-02-26 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(599284, 61225, 8891, '<td valign="top">Think this might have worked better without the hot spots but as they are there, then perhaps losing some of the image might give a more extraordinary look. you might have considered a CW rotation and cropping from the top most drops down. It might be more abstract that way but the idea that it is an apple is too evident in the image as it is.</td>', 'Think this might have worked better without the hot spots but as they are there, then perhaps losing some of the image might give a more extraordinary look. you might have considered a CW rotation and cropping from the top most drops down. It might be more abstract that way but the idea that it is an apple is too evident in the image as it is.', '2004-02-26 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(599285, 61226, 15305, '<td valign="top">Poor pole, what is it been punished for?  Interesting shot, a different POV could improve the composition.</td>', 'Poor pole, what is it been punished for?  Interesting shot, a different POV could improve the composition.', '2004-02-26 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(599287, 60751, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, interesting lighting and coloring.</td>', 'Nice shot, interesting lighting and coloring.', '2004-02-26 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(599290, 61794, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is very busy and almost hard to look at.  My eye tries to find a place to rest, but can''t with all the chaotic lines.  The butterfly doesn''t seem to be quite enough of an anchor to give this a focal point.  I am not sure what is supposed to be mundane either....<br/>TC</td>', 'This is very busy and almost hard to look at.  My eye tries to find a place to rest, but can''t with all the chaotic lines.  The butterfly doesn''t seem to be quite enough of an anchor to give this a focal point.  I am not sure what is supposed to be mundane either....TC', '2004-02-26 01:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(599292, 61604, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very interesting composition and color contrast.</td>', 'Great shot. Very interesting composition and color contrast.', '2004-02-26 01:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(599294, 61552, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot....like the old swingline is an martial arts movie jumping up into the air and shooting off a blast of staples.   Very novel, creative and innovative. Like this very much. THinking that I know how you did it makes it a bit better except that I wish that you had considered cloning the away the reflections of the staples in the mirror.  It might have been just a bit more effective. Just a nit. But you can do that in the member challenge so why not?  Cool none- the- less.</td>', 'Very cool shot....like the old swingline is an martial arts movie jumping up into the air and shooting off a blast of staples.   Very novel, creative and innovative. Like this very much. THinking that I know how you did it makes it a bit better except that I wish that you had considered cloning the away the reflections of the staples in the mirror.  It might have been just a bit more effective. Just a nit. But you can do that in the member challenge so why not?  Cool none- the- less.', '2004-02-26 01:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(599297, 61492, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very sharp shot.  Awesome focus.  Great color scheme.  Love the shot itself.  One thing that ruins it for this viewer though.  Your border isn''t even and I see this before I see the shot itself because of it''s presentation value.  Still a great shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very sharp shot.  Awesome focus.  Great color scheme.  Love the shot itself.  One thing that ruins it for this viewer though.  Your border isn''t even and I see this before I see the shot itself because of it''s presentation value.  Still a great shot.TC', '2004-02-26 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(599302, 61796, 8891, '<td valign="top">just a personal note: Your profile scares me as much as mine does me. That being said, the straight on shot is very nice but the right and left profiles almost seem as if they are of another person.</td>', 'just a personal note: Your profile scares me as much as mine does me. That being said, the straight on shot is very nice but the right and left profiles almost seem as if they are of another person.', '2004-02-26 01:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
