(599309, 60992, 8891, '<td valign="top">not enough definition of the subject to let me have an idea of what it was. I know what a swingline is, but if I didn''t, I would not be able to tell from this.</td>', 'not enough definition of the subject to let me have an idea of what it was. I know what a swingline is, but if I didn''t, I would not be able to tell from this.', '2004-02-26 01:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
