(599328, 61555, 8891, '<td valign="top">this might be more appealing flipped 180. the Up dark and Down light does not work for me and the glow looks better at the bottom as it is and I would rather see that at the top.</td>', 'this might be more appealing flipped 180. the Up dark and Down light does not work for me and the glow looks better at the bottom as it is and I would rather see that at the top.', '2004-02-26 01:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
