(599342, 61587, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think you might have considered loosing the the roll and just leaving the single strand of tissue floating in the air.  Nice compostion but and the detail on the tissue is very good, but the sky is real grainy.</td>', 'I think you might have considered loosing the the roll and just leaving the single strand of tissue floating in the air.  Nice compostion but and the detail on the tissue is very good, but the sky is real grainy.', '2004-02-26 01:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
