(599518, 61465, 11800, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very good and shows off the objects selected to their best. I''m thinking that it would be more harmonic if the human part could be more easily recognised. As far as the clothespin goes, you did an outstanding job.</td>', 'The lighting is very good and shows off the objects selected to their best. I''m thinking that it would be more harmonic if the human part could be more easily recognised. As far as the clothespin goes, you did an outstanding job.', '2004-02-26 03:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(599521, 61795, 11800, '<td valign="top">Colorful, interesting abstract. The positions of the straws give some depth to the photo. Only nit pick, I would have cloned oth the hair on the green straw.</td>', 'Colorful, interesting abstract. The positions of the straws give some depth to the photo. Only nit pick, I would have cloned oth the hair on the green straw.', '2004-02-26 04:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(599525, 61518, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty pen. Like the dof and the composition. The colors(wb) go well with the subject. I do think the focus would have been more effective on the point of the pen. Focus point depends on what the photographer wants to highlight in the photo, so I guess there could be something else I''m not understanding, sorry.</td>', 'Pretty pen. Like the dof and the composition. The colors(wb) go well with the subject. I do think the focus would have been more effective on the point of the pen. Focus point depends on what the photographer wants to highlight in the photo, so I guess there could be something else I''m not understanding, sorry.', '2004-02-26 04:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(599530, 61689, 11800, '<td valign="top">LOL. too funny. How long did he have to hang up there before the other one shot one in? Technically, it''s leaning over to the left? It looks like a snapshot, which I think adds to the charm of the picture but maybe reshoot it somewhere that doesn''t have all the background distractions and it would be a winner. It''s such a wonderful idea!</td>', 'LOL. too funny. How long did he have to hang up there before the other one shot one in? Technically, it''s leaning over to the left? It looks like a snapshot, which I think adds to the charm of the picture but maybe reshoot it somewhere that doesn''t have all the background distractions and it would be a winner. It''s such a wonderful idea!', '2004-02-26 04:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(599541, 61359, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good color coordination. I like how the color splashes forward from the bottles onto the satin. If I only looked at the bottom of this picture, I would like it a lot. Sorry if the following is considered negative. The picture is tilting to the right, the blown out part of the blue bottle and glass is distracting and the background distracts.</td>', 'Good color coordination. I like how the color splashes forward from the bottles onto the satin. If I only looked at the bottom of this picture, I would like it a lot. Sorry if the following is considered negative. The picture is tilting to the right, the blown out part of the blue bottle and glass is distracting and the background distracts.', '2004-02-26 04:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(599547, 61590, 11800, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Just when I think I can''t stand one more cd picture. The title helps point out that I should be looking for the reflections and not just the cds. The upright cd adds dimension to the whole set up. Nice. Very professional, clean image.</td>', 'Excellent. Just when I think I can''t stand one more cd picture. The title helps point out that I should be looking for the reflections and not just the cds. The upright cd adds dimension to the whole set up. Nice. Very professional, clean image.', '2004-02-26 04:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(599552, 61853, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty scene. I don''t know about all the negative space. It seems a lot of space was given up and the only payoff is seeing the small opening of the bridge. I''m more than likely wrong about this, but that''s how I feel. Personally, I would have liked to see the building framed between one set of uprights.</td>', 'This is a pretty scene. I don''t know about all the negative space. It seems a lot of space was given up and the only payoff is seeing the small opening of the bridge. I''m more than likely wrong about this, but that''s how I feel. Personally, I would have liked to see the building framed between one set of uprights.', '2004-02-26 04:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(599560, 61758, 11800, '<td valign="top">So tiny on the earth. Wonderful photo. The perspective makes it seem to be so insignificant, yet that could be any manner of toxic junk that''s pouring out into the environment. The blue tone and black earth behind the plant adds to the feeling of doom I get from the picture.</td>', 'So tiny on the earth. Wonderful photo. The perspective makes it seem to be so insignificant, yet that could be any manner of toxic junk that''s pouring out into the environment. The blue tone and black earth behind the plant adds to the feeling of doom I get from the picture.', '2004-02-26 05:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
