(599795, 61555, 11800, '<td valign="top">The lighting set up is good and the colors are pretty. It looks like soft focus, but even with that technique, there should be something in focus. It looks like everything is oof, even the hair(?) on the side which should have been cloned out,imo. It''s an interesting picture that could use a little more work to make it perfect.</td>', 'The lighting set up is good and the colors are pretty. It looks like soft focus, but even with that technique, there should be something in focus. It looks like everything is oof, even the hair(?) on the side which should have been cloned out,imo. It''s an interesting picture that could use a little more work to make it perfect.', '2004-02-26 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(599814, 61789, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good timing. It''s a little soft on the duck and the snow is blown out with fringing. I appreciate the effort it might have taken to get this shot, however an excellent picture consists of a good number of things that come together at the right moment. Without all the good things being present, you have a record of your attempt, but not a stunning photo. Sorry. 5</td>', 'Good timing. It''s a little soft on the duck and the snow is blown out with fringing. I appreciate the effort it might have taken to get this shot, however an excellent picture consists of a good number of things that come together at the right moment. Without all the good things being present, you have a record of your attempt, but not a stunning photo. Sorry. 5', '2004-02-26 11:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(599823, 61806, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The color is done in a realistic manner. Hope you left comments as to how you set up the lights.</td>', 'Interesting. The color is done in a realistic manner. Hope you left comments as to how you set up the lights.', '2004-02-26 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
