(600939, 61228, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic and cat.</td>', 'Beautiful pic and cat.', '2004-02-27 02:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(600979, 60991, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good stuff - tone, colour, detail. Not wholly convinced it really holds a great amount of interst for me - perhaps just lacking an edge of subtlety somewhere. But it''s very strong work, nevertheless.</td>', 'Good stuff - tone, colour, detail. Not wholly convinced it really holds a great amount of interst for me - perhaps just lacking an edge of subtlety somewhere. But it''s very strong work, nevertheless.', '2004-02-27 05:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(600980, 61631, 6999, '<td valign="top">Does it matter that I can''t work out what this is? I think, given the challenge, that it does, a bit. It''s a pleasant shot though, great tonally, and nicely composed. I like the light in this very much. I''d guess it''s a frozen flower melting, but...</td>', 'Does it matter that I can''t work out what this is? I think, given the challenge, that it does, a bit. It''s a pleasant shot though, great tonally, and nicely composed. I like the light in this very much. I''d guess it''s a frozen flower melting, but...', '2004-02-27 05:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(600981, 61854, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve gone a bit too far with sheer numbers here - especially in a very busy composition - a pile of forks, rather than an organisation of them. Technically well done, obviously, but I think you''ve also taken the contrast a bit too far to give a really extraordinary effect.</td>', 'I think you''ve gone a bit too far with sheer numbers here - especially in a very busy composition - a pile of forks, rather than an organisation of them. Technically well done, obviously, but I think you''ve also taken the contrast a bit too far to give a really extraordinary effect.', '2004-02-27 05:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(600983, 61379, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems odd at best to show this in a landscape orientation - of what use is all that dead space? Added to which, the positioning of this design in frame is pretty weak - dead centre is always tricky. Beyond that, this is really a very flat photo - more about the design than the photography - a record, rather than a creative endeavour, if you see what I mean.</td>', 'Seems odd at best to show this in a landscape orientation - of what use is all that dead space? Added to which, the positioning of this design in frame is pretty weak - dead centre is always tricky. Beyond that, this is really a very flat photo - more about the design than the photography - a record, rather than a creative endeavour, if you see what I mean.', '2004-02-27 05:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(601079, 60991, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the specialness you''ve given this object! It is slightly off kilter, but I find that a good thing, as it reminds one that it is, after all, made by humans. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the specialness you''ve given this object! It is slightly off kilter, but I find that a good thing, as it reminds one that it is, after all, made by humans. Nice work.', '2004-02-27 09:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(601080, 61562, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea and very intense macro.the pepper corn is especially effective, though I wish the salt were more defined. Nice work.</td>', 'Fun idea and very intense macro.the pepper corn is especially effective, though I wish the salt were more defined. Nice work.', '2004-02-27 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(601082, 61675, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your angle here, and the glowing buttons. Both add specialness to this mundane object. You may want to experiment with contrast or boosting saturation to get just slightly more clarity from the image, but this is nice work.</td>', 'I like your angle here, and the glowing buttons. Both add specialness to this mundane object. You may want to experiment with contrast or boosting saturation to get just slightly more clarity from the image, but this is nice work.', '2004-02-27 09:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(601083, 61771, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work! The fork is a nice lead-in to the shot, and adds both interest and balance. Lighting is nice and bright, glorifying the peas  just enough to make them interesting without overwhelming us with some kind of magic. The image suffers in clarity just a little, but I still like it a lot. 8</td>', 'Nice work! The fork is a nice lead-in to the shot, and adds both interest and balance. Lighting is nice and bright, glorifying the peas  just enough to make them interesting without overwhelming us with some kind of magic. The image suffers in clarity just a little, but I still like it a lot. 8', '2004-02-27 09:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(601084, 61557, 6870, '<td valign="top">Exquisite tones, and an interesting point of view. Good balance too. This is super work. 10</td>', 'Exquisite tones, and an interesting point of view. Good balance too. This is super work. 10', '2004-02-27 09:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(601085, 61782, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever! I love the message on the box, which added to your lighting makes this box special indeed.</td>', 'Clever! I love the message on the box, which added to your lighting makes this box special indeed.', '2004-02-27 09:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(601087, 61659, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, added to the nice use of light and shadow, makes this fork special!</td>', 'Interesting angle, added to the nice use of light and shadow, makes this fork special!', '2004-02-27 09:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(601089, 61377, 6870, '<td valign="top">The bowls seem to glow! I love the effect. you may want to experiment with cropping tighter, or using a different background, though, as the paper, table, and square things don''t seem to add to your communication. I love how the bowls are slightly askew and not perfectly placed. It adds details that are more interesting to look at.</td>', 'The bowls seem to glow! I love the effect. you may want to experiment with cropping tighter, or using a different background, though, as the paper, table, and square things don''t seem to add to your communication. I love how the bowls are slightly askew and not perfectly placed. It adds details that are more interesting to look at.', '2004-02-27 09:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(601090, 61230, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice, high key approach here. Just a fun image! 8</td>', 'Nice, high key approach here. Just a fun image! 8', '2004-02-27 09:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(601092, 61481, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good symmetry.  But all the brush makes it too busy IMHO.  I think these work better when they are simpler.</td>', 'Good idea and good symmetry.  But all the brush makes it too busy IMHO.  I think these work better when they are simpler.', '2004-02-27 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(601093, 61492, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image belongs in those magazine games where you have to guess what the macro shot is. Very interesting work! Composition and light are used well here. 9</td>', 'This image belongs in those magazine games where you have to guess what the macro shot is. Very interesting work! Composition and light are used well here. 9', '2004-02-27 09:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(601095, 61860, 6870, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time seeing any human being as mundane, but I so like this image. the balance and tones are very nice, and the clarity is super.</td>', 'I have a hard time seeing any human being as mundane, but I so like this image. the balance and tones are very nice, and the clarity is super.', '2004-02-27 09:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(601096, 61429, 6870, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time seeing a flower as mundane, but I love how you''ve isolated the flower here with both light and color and focus. it would also be nice to have the entire flower in focus.</td>', 'I have a hard time seeing a flower as mundane, but I love how you''ve isolated the flower here with both light and color and focus. it would also be nice to have the entire flower in focus.', '2004-02-27 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(601097, 60897, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really fun idea! Well executed, too, though some of the forks have some harsh highlights. But I''m being nitpicky. This is a good shot. 8</td>', 'Really fun idea! Well executed, too, though some of the forks have some harsh highlights. But I''m being nitpicky. This is a good shot. 8', '2004-02-27 09:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(601099, 61835, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever title! I don''t see money as mundane as it is so often sought, but your title and image are not of  money--they are about paper and ink, so high marks! 8</td>', 'Clever title! I don''t see money as mundane as it is so often sought, but your title and image are not of  money--they are about paper and ink, so high marks! 8', '2004-02-27 09:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(601110, 61727, 8624, '<td valign="top">excellent macro - tack sharp and an interesting angle presented. the red background works great</td>', 'excellent macro - tack sharp and an interesting angle presented. the red background works great', '2004-02-27 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(601111, 61496, 8624, '<td valign="top">good composition. I like the way you brought the diagonals in via the brick cracks leading the eye right to the subject.</td>', 'good composition. I like the way you brought the diagonals in via the brick cracks leading the eye right to the subject.', '2004-02-27 09:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(601112, 61018, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice macro, but looks a little oversharpened. also, I''d prefer to see the wires within more in focus.</td>', 'nice macro, but looks a little oversharpened. also, I''d prefer to see the wires within more in focus.', '2004-02-27 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(601116, 61652, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is the cleverest entry I have seen yet.  The lettering on hte fron cartridge could be sharper, but this is very good.  I hope you win.</td>', 'This is the cleverest entry I have seen yet.  The lettering on hte fron cartridge could be sharper, but this is very good.  I hope you win.', '2004-02-27 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(601117, 61788, 8624, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but the thing I like is the digital effect you added, not just the composition of the leaf itself. Unfortunately, this pushes it, for me, into a digital art composition rather than a photographic one.</td>', 'I really like this, but the thing I like is the digital effect you added, not just the composition of the leaf itself. Unfortunately, this pushes it, for me, into a digital art composition rather than a photographic one.', '2004-02-27 09:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(601118, 61751, 8624, '<td valign="top">may favorite of the challenge. clever and simple. mundane objects put together in a very interesting way. well done!</td>', 'may favorite of the challenge. clever and simple. mundane objects put together in a very interesting way. well done!', '2004-02-27 09:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
