(601197, 60898, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this photo....I hope you do well with the other votes, but these type of digitally manipulated photos never seem to do really well.....nice artistic photo</td>', 'I like this photo....I hope you do well with the other votes, but these type of digitally manipulated photos never seem to do really well.....nice artistic photo', '2004-02-27 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(601203, 61807, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo.....I like the digital manipulation, but these type of photos usually don''t score very highly....I''m in favor of challenging that idea!  The abstract reflections in the windows almost look like strange distortd faces!</td>', 'nice photo.....I like the digital manipulation, but these type of photos usually don''t score very highly....I''m in favor of challenging that idea!  The abstract reflections in the windows almost look like strange distortd faces!', '2004-02-27 12:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(601205, 61679, 13772, '<td valign="top">Very clever and interesting! IMO it is a very well done pic. Only thing I could think of is maybe if I could see the whole tool and a little bigger moon. It could be a full moon. Most animals howl at full moons (at least in the movies, ha,ha). Good job!</td>', 'Very clever and interesting! IMO it is a very well done pic. Only thing I could think of is maybe if I could see the whole tool and a little bigger moon. It could be a full moon. Most animals howl at full moons (at least in the movies, ha,ha). Good job!', '2004-02-27 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(601211, 61719, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo....I''m not sure exactly what it is, so I will be looking at your explanation for it....love the feel....composition....background etc..</td>', 'nice photo....I''m not sure exactly what it is, so I will be looking at your explanation for it....love the feel....composition....background etc..', '2004-02-27 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(601215, 61659, 14593, '<td valign="top">very interesting....I like it.  The shadow makes for an usual perspective of a very mundane subject.  I am giving this a 10!</td>', 'very interesting....I like it.  The shadow makes for an usual perspective of a very mundane subject.  I am giving this a 10!', '2004-02-27 12:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(601218, 61631, 13772, '<td valign="top">This picture really strikes an emotion. I like the composition and the lighting is nice. The shadow running to the corner is a nice touch. The only thing I find distracting is the hot spot in the center of the leaf. It is a great pic and thank you for the great work!</td>', 'This picture really strikes an emotion. I like the composition and the lighting is nice. The shadow running to the corner is a nice touch. The only thing I find distracting is the hot spot in the center of the leaf. It is a great pic and thank you for the great work!', '2004-02-27 12:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(601220, 61335, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.....I''m almost not sure what to make of it.  This is the second time I''ve viewed it before voting on it.  The colors and details really pop out at the viewer....I''m curious how much it has been digitally manipulated....I am coming back to this one after the voting is over and details are posted....</td>', 'I like this photo.....I''m almost not sure what to make of it.  This is the second time I''ve viewed it before voting on it.  The colors and details really pop out at the viewer....I''m curious how much it has been digitally manipulated....I am coming back to this one after the voting is over and details are posted....', '2004-02-27 12:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(601222, 61814, 13772, '<td valign="top">Vey interesting. Makes me want to peep and see what is on the other side. Nice work!</td>', 'Vey interesting. Makes me want to peep and see what is on the other side. Nice work!', '2004-02-27 12:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(601224, 60751, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice window treatment with the daylight streaming in......I like the way you cropped it too.....long and lean....gives it much more impact!</td>', 'nice window treatment with the daylight streaming in......I like the way you cropped it too.....long and lean....gives it much more impact!', '2004-02-27 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
