(601238, 61686, 14593, '<td valign="top">wow....talk about a wonderful unique photo opportunity.....I really like it!</td>', 'wow....talk about a wonderful unique photo opportunity.....I really like it!', '2004-02-27 12:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(601244, 61793, 14593, '<td valign="top">I''ve photographed many ice-covered branches, but never with such a beautiful backdrop....nice photo!  I love the nice crystal clear close-up against the beautiful background</td>', 'I''ve photographed many ice-covered branches, but never with such a beautiful backdrop....nice photo!  I love the nice crystal clear close-up against the beautiful background', '2004-02-27 12:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(601248, 61631, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo....love the details and the muted colors against the black background...nicely done</td>', 'nice photo....love the details and the muted colors against the black background...nicely done', '2004-02-27 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(601250, 61562, 13772, '<td valign="top">I have never looked at salt and pepper this close before. I find it very interesting. Plus are you trying to get a better vote by having the pepper corn stick its tongue out at us!?! It looks like a face sticking its tongue out if you had not noticed.Nice work</td>', 'I have never looked at salt and pepper this close before. I find it very interesting. Plus are you trying to get a better vote by having the pepper corn stick its tongue out at us!?! It looks like a face sticking its tongue out if you had not noticed.Nice work', '2004-02-27 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(601255, 61737, 14593, '<td valign="top">I owned a Chihuahua for years....my son has him now.   nice looking dog!  I like the natural  lighting in this photo also</td>', 'I owned a Chihuahua for years....my son has him now.   nice looking dog!  I like the natural  lighting in this photo also', '2004-02-27 12:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(601397, 61572, 11800, '<td valign="top">The yellow is really vibrant and the other colors seem to be accurate. I think the composition would have been more effective if the whole handset had been shown. Seems to have a few bright spots. Maybe reducing your ev would help, if you have that ability with your camera. That data port is an interesting feature!</td>', 'The yellow is really vibrant and the other colors seem to be accurate. I think the composition would have been more effective if the whole handset had been shown. Seems to have a few bright spots. Maybe reducing your ev would help, if you have that ability with your camera. That data port is an interesting feature!', '2004-02-27 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(601420, 61414, 11800, '<td valign="top">pretty colors,pretty picture. The selective focus keeps this from being boring by letting all the colors run together. Great color rendition.</td>', 'pretty colors,pretty picture. The selective focus keeps this from being boring by letting all the colors run together. Great color rendition.', '2004-02-27 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(601430, 61592, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice concept with good execution. Sorry, but the halo is just too much to be able to view this comfortably. Maybe try to reshoot it so it is as sharp as you want it to be or let her go a bit fuzzy.</td>', 'Nice concept with good execution. Sorry, but the halo is just too much to be able to view this comfortably. Maybe try to reshoot it so it is as sharp as you want it to be or let her go a bit fuzzy.', '2004-02-27 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(601443, 61809, 11800, '<td valign="top">I had to pass this by the first time because I couldn''t see it. Now I do. My eyes wanted to make all the dark part into the background. Interesting.</td>', 'I had to pass this by the first time because I couldn''t see it. Now I do. My eyes wanted to make all the dark part into the background. Interesting.', '2004-02-27 14:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(601545, 61719, 12252, '<td valign="top">Sorry, can''t vote but I really like your image. Nice job!</td>', 'Sorry, can''t vote but I really like your image. Nice job!', '2004-02-27 15:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(601547, 61771, 12252, '<td valign="top">Good effort! Simple, nicely done.</td>', 'Good effort! Simple, nicely done.', '2004-02-27 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
