(602061, 61861, 5822, '<td valign="top">Whlie the colors are quite appertizing I find this capture to be too literal and too sharpened. Also, I don''t think you had to lift up the tablecloth in the background.  You''ve also got some blown out hightlights on top probably from lighting that is too harsh.</td>', 'Whlie the colors are quite appertizing I find this capture to be too literal and too sharpened. Also, I don''t think you had to lift up the tablecloth in the background.  You''ve also got some blown out hightlights on top probably from lighting that is too harsh.', '2004-02-28 00:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
