(602198, 61557, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures and great toning.</td>', 'Wonderful textures and great toning.', '2004-02-28 05:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(602199, 60897, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the use of lighting here and to complete the image I may have put a spoon in the void being that it''s spoon shaped. Neat photo.</td>', 'I like the use of lighting here and to complete the image I may have put a spoon in the void being that it''s spoon shaped. Neat photo.', '2004-02-28 05:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(602200, 61444, 5822, '<td valign="top">DOF a bit too narrow, I would have liked to have seen the entire stapler in focus.  Lighting is too harsh and there is too much happening colorwise. Way too busy. In addition, I would like to have seen a different angle of view as you can see the distant background of the room in the upper right hand corner.  Highlight in upper left is blown out.</td>', 'DOF a bit too narrow, I would have liked to have seen the entire stapler in focus.  Lighting is too harsh and there is too much happening colorwise. Way too busy. In addition, I would like to have seen a different angle of view as you can see the distant background of the room in the upper right hand corner.  Highlight in upper left is blown out.', '2004-02-28 05:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(602207, 61622, 12160, '<td valign="top">Like the warm color of the lighting, well-composed. It does look extra ordinary. 8</td>', 'Like the warm color of the lighting, well-composed. It does look extra ordinary. 8', '2004-02-28 06:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(602209, 61666, 12160, '<td valign="top">Creative, love the idea. simple and fits the challenge.</td>', 'Creative, love the idea. simple and fits the challenge.', '2004-02-28 06:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(602211, 60897, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice work of art, creative and simple. Works really well in black/white. 8</td>', 'Nice work of art, creative and simple. Works really well in black/white. 8', '2004-02-28 06:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(602213, 60733, 12160, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat idea, the focus is clear and the subjects are mundane so it fits the challenge. Two things I should mention: (1) The white background is overexposed as well as the plate where the orange is on, the plate completely lost any detail. (2). It looks like your lighting source is above your subjects. Are the lighting sources of not equal intensity? I say that because the shadows are not the same. Or it could be because the plate is clear and the mug is dark. 5</td>', 'It''s a neat idea, the focus is clear and the subjects are mundane so it fits the challenge. Two things I should mention: (1) The white background is overexposed as well as the plate where the orange is on, the plate completely lost any detail. (2). It looks like your lighting source is above your subjects. Are the lighting sources of not equal intensity? I say that because the shadows are not the same. Or it could be because the plate is clear and the mug is dark. 5', '2004-02-28 07:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(602214, 61831, 15002, '<td valign="top">very clever, I like it</td>', 'very clever, I like it', '2004-02-28 07:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
