(602320, 61814, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now this is good work indeed - and I''m pretty certain will be going straight into my faves after the challenge. Huge and immediate impact. Fabulous detailing, light, contrast (both technically and of tone), blance of composition, and that edge of fascination about whatever the hell is in the background. edgy stuff, and perfectly mundane - exactly what the challenge was after. if there were justice, this will win (and I haven''t even seen all the shots yet) ... but I wonder if the masses will find your colouration a touch too odd?</td>', 'Now this is good work indeed - and I''m pretty certain will be going straight into my faves after the challenge. Huge and immediate impact. Fabulous detailing, light, contrast (both technically and of tone), blance of composition, and that edge of fascination about whatever the hell is in the background. edgy stuff, and perfectly mundane - exactly what the challenge was after. if there were justice, this will win (and I haven''t even seen all the shots yet) ... but I wonder if the masses will find your colouration a touch too odd?', '2004-02-28 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
