(603342, 61851, 4285, '<td valign="top">Decent macro shot. I like the tilt of the screw - compositionally, it is eye catching. B &amp; W works well for this shot.</td>', 'Decent macro shot. I like the tilt of the screw - compositionally, it is eye catching. B & W works well for this shot.', '2004-02-29 07:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(603344, 61429, 4285, '<td valign="top">I like you use of DOF. I also think that your colours are good. Shadows are your worst enemy in this shot. Shooting at a different time of day or using flash fill may have improved it. 6</td>', 'I like you use of DOF. I also think that your colours are good. Shadows are your worst enemy in this shot. Shooting at a different time of day or using flash fill may have improved it. 6', '2004-02-29 07:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(603349, 61759, 5728, '<td valign="top">My pick for a top 3 placing. This is excellent, the combination of blue and red tones and glass works perfectly for me. Well done!</td>', 'My pick for a top 3 placing. This is excellent, the combination of blue and red tones and glass works perfectly for me. Well done!', '2004-02-29 07:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(603350, 61696, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good work! This is my choice for a top 3 placing.</td>', 'Good work! This is my choice for a top 3 placing.', '2004-02-29 07:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(603369, 61600, 179, '<td valign="top">I really love the simplicity of this shot. The contrast is flawless and right on target which is often the problem with most B&amp;W shots here. The only problem I have with this is the shot is heavy on the left side, and seems unbalenced to my eye.<br/>Score: 8 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'I really love the simplicity of this shot. The contrast is flawless and right on target which is often the problem with most B&W shots here. The only problem I have with this is the shot is heavy on the left side, and seems unbalenced to my eye.Score: 8 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-29 09:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(603370, 60944, 179, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs.An excellent depiction of the challenge. Amazing colors, great DoF and the composition just brings it all together. I''m sorry to say I have nothing constructive to say about this shot. When it''s good, it''s good! Score: 10 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favs.An excellent depiction of the challenge. Amazing colors, great DoF and the composition just brings it all together. I''m sorry to say I have nothing constructive to say about this shot. When it''s good, it''s good! Score: 10 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-29 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(603372, 61742, 179, '<td valign="top">Great DoF here, nice subject, good colors. I would have liked to have see the name a little more. Score: 9 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'Great DoF here, nice subject, good colors. I would have liked to have see the name a little more. Score: 9 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-29 09:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(603374, 61719, 179, '<td valign="top">One of those "I wonder what that is" photo. Original, great composition as far as I''m concerned. Simple and effective. The only thing preventing me from giving this a perfect score is I don''t know what it is, thus I can''t calibrate the "mudane" part of it.Score: 9 Awesome job! Good Luck!</td>', 'One of those "I wonder what that is" photo. Original, great composition as far as I''m concerned. Simple and effective. The only thing preventing me from giving this a perfect score is I don''t know what it is, thus I can''t calibrate the "mudane" part of it.Score: 9 Awesome job! Good Luck!', '2004-02-29 09:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(603375, 61493, 179, '<td valign="top">Somehow I could see this as a book cover. A really nice shot that has a simple originality to it. The only thing bothering me in this is the grass at the bottom, I would have liked everything very dark except for the stars and the chair. But even that is knitpicking! Score: 9 Great job! Good luck!</td>', 'Somehow I could see this as a book cover. A really nice shot that has a simple originality to it. The only thing bothering me in this is the grass at the bottom, I would have liked everything very dark except for the stars and the chair. But even that is knitpicking! Score: 9 Great job! Good luck!', '2004-02-29 09:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(603380, 61333, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the tone and softness of the subject. Not crazy about the huge dark vignette surrouding the chair on the uneveness of the area directly around the chair. Still very nice overall.</td>', 'Like the tone and softness of the subject. Not crazy about the huge dark vignette surrouding the chair on the uneveness of the area directly around the chair. Still very nice overall.', '2004-02-29 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(603382, 61226, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, detail wise and exposure though it appears to me to be a bit noisy and /or over sharpened..  It still looks pretty mundane to me.</td>', 'Very nice shot, detail wise and exposure though it appears to me to be a bit noisy and /or over sharpened..  It still looks pretty mundane to me.', '2004-02-29 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(603383, 61847, 8891, '<td valign="top">The idea of this is quite poignant and the mundaity severe. However, the image accentuates the mundane and does not make it look particulary extraordinary. I think BW was not the way to go and that the various colors of the drugs might have made it look less mundane. But trying to make this particular subject look other than mundane is quite, thankfully, beyond me.</td>', 'The idea of this is quite poignant and the mundaity severe. However, the image accentuates the mundane and does not make it look particulary extraordinary. I think BW was not the way to go and that the various colors of the drugs might have made it look less mundane. But trying to make this particular subject look other than mundane is quite, thankfully, beyond me.', '2004-02-29 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(603384, 61831, 8891, '<td valign="top">still bulbs.....might have suggested some sort of design made by the bulbs with these or more.  Light the lit one lighting the other two a lot.</td>', 'still bulbs.....might have suggested some sort of design made by the bulbs with these or more.  Light the lit one lighting the other two a lot.', '2004-02-29 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(603385, 61848, 8891, '<td valign="top">The focus due to the motion of the dogs is a bit off, but everyone in the office likes the shot  A LOT!  So I''ll go with them.</td>', 'The focus due to the motion of the dogs is a bit off, but everyone in the office likes the shot  A LOT!  So I''ll go with them.', '2004-02-29 10:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(603388, 61557, 8891, '<td valign="top">like this is BW and my only nit would have been a slight change in your POV to your right and losing the bit of shadow on the upper left corner.</td>', 'like this is BW and my only nit would have been a slight change in your POV to your right and losing the bit of shadow on the upper left corner.', '2004-02-29 10:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(603389, 61417, 8891, '<td valign="top">All a blur....like the lighting highlights.</td>', 'All a blur....like the lighting highlights.', '2004-02-29 10:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(603392, 61335, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think the attempt was to make this sort of a water color? not sure but crave more saturation of the colors and a less bright upper third of the image.</td>', 'I think the attempt was to make this sort of a water color? not sure but crave more saturation of the colors and a less bright upper third of the image.', '2004-02-29 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(603394, 61578, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think I sort of get it but not entirely sure.  I like the full fob, nice definition and colors.  I think the echo should not have been butted up to the left of the frame, though it do like the effect of the echo.</td>', 'I think I sort of get it but not entirely sure.  I like the full fob, nice definition and colors.  I think the echo should not have been butted up to the left of the frame, though it do like the effect of the echo.', '2004-02-29 10:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
