(603398, 61843, 8891, '<td valign="top">The composition makes this look quite extraordinary and the wonderful sky and clouds are a great contrast to the lines of the subject.  Very fine and one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'The composition makes this look quite extraordinary and the wonderful sky and clouds are a great contrast to the lines of the subject.  Very fine and one of my favorites so far.', '2004-02-29 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
