(603465, 61560, 16829, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite compositions of the group. Can''t say a thing about how it might be better.</td>', 'One of my favorite compositions of the group. Can''t say a thing about how it might be better.', '2004-02-29 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(603466, 61742, 16829, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I like the centered sharpness, with softening in all directions. Very effective for the subject.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I like the centered sharpness, with softening in all directions. Very effective for the subject.', '2004-02-29 13:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(603472, 61557, 16829, '<td valign="top">While I like all the elements of the picture, (the subject, the arrangement, the textures, the monochrome treatment), here is what I think detracts from the whole. If you draw a line down the center, top to bottom, the right half has no real interest. It is just a continuation of elements from the left, and doesn''t "become" a negative space. Having all the interest of the subject weighted to the left usually effects one''s subconscious as darker, or awry, or discordant. A mental diconnect. This effect does not seem appropriate to the subject, and to my eye, detracts from the overall effectiveness of the picture. A different cropping might make all the difference.</td>', 'While I like all the elements of the picture, (the subject, the arrangement, the textures, the monochrome treatment), here is what I think detracts from the whole. If you draw a line down the center, top to bottom, the right half has no real interest. It is just a continuation of elements from the left, and doesn''t "become" a negative space. Having all the interest of the subject weighted to the left usually effects one''s subconscious as darker, or awry, or discordant. A mental diconnect. This effect does not seem appropriate to the subject, and to my eye, detracts from the overall effectiveness of the picture. A different cropping might make all the difference.', '2004-02-29 13:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
