(603656, 61479, 8891, '<td valign="top">The CD is too centered in the frame. Like the use of the cooper toned leaves to make it more extraordinary.  Aren''t you glad we use CD''s in Digital Photography. What ever would we do if we had to use vinyl! LOL!.</td>', 'The CD is too centered in the frame. Like the use of the cooper toned leaves to make it more extraordinary.  Aren''t you glad we use CD''s in Digital Photography. What ever would we do if we had to use vinyl! LOL!.', '2004-02-29 17:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
