(603801, 61496, 10084, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept. Definitely a mundane subject made extraordinary. The red of the concrete is a great contrast to the green of the weed and makes it pop out of the shot. Love the leading lines that the concrete , makes you eyes focus on the weed itself. The white of the weed gives an extra touch of beauty to the ordinary weed. From a "9" to a "10".</td>', 'Excellent concept. Definitely a mundane subject made extraordinary. The red of the concrete is a great contrast to the green of the weed and makes it pop out of the shot. Love the leading lines that the concrete , makes you eyes focus on the weed itself. The white of the weed gives an extra touch of beauty to the ordinary weed. From a "9" to a "10".', '2004-02-29 21:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
