(603970, 61834, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field makes this composition very interesting. Love the colors captured in the powder. Really like the textures especiallu on the brush. The plastic handle, metallic, and the soft of the tip. "10"</td>', 'Great depth of field makes this composition very interesting. Love the colors captured in the powder. Really like the textures especiallu on the brush. The plastic handle, metallic, and the soft of the tip. "10"', '2004-02-29 23:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(603972, 61696, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp picture. Composition is very interesting. The desaturation effect really makes the subject pop out of the shot. Love the crisp highlights in the water. It gives a great dynamic feeling of the swirling water. Contrast and brightness is perfect. "10"</td>', 'Very clear and sharp picture. Composition is very interesting. The desaturation effect really makes the subject pop out of the shot. Love the crisp highlights in the water. It gives a great dynamic feeling of the swirling water. Contrast and brightness is perfect. "10"', '2004-02-29 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(603977, 61805, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good fill the frame shot. Would love to see the top left and right filled with the jelly beans. Leaving these space empty just makes your eyes focus in on them. If not cropping lower would really help. Would make for a nice add for Jelly Belly.</td>', 'Good fill the frame shot. Would love to see the top left and right filled with the jelly beans. Leaving these space empty just makes your eyes focus in on them. If not cropping lower would really help. Would make for a nice add for Jelly Belly.', '2004-02-29 23:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(603981, 61727, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp sharp picture. The diagonal cropping makes the shot dynamic and even more interesting. The colors works will together. Great textures represented. "9"</td>', 'Nice crisp sharp picture. The diagonal cropping makes the shot dynamic and even more interesting. The colors works will together. Great textures represented. "9"', '2004-02-29 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(603985, 61230, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interestingly simple but great composition. The vibrant red heart on the soap really makes a statement. Love the white on white setup. You still get the sense of the oval shape of the soap. Would make for a great ad for "Dove". "9"</td>', 'Interestingly simple but great composition. The vibrant red heart on the soap really makes a statement. Love the white on white setup. You still get the sense of the oval shape of the soap. Would make for a great ad for "Dove". "9"', '2004-02-29 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(603987, 61333, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting effect and I like the toning.  I know it''s difficult without editing but this would be improved withought the hotspots (mainly the one on the arm and the one showing through the back left of the chair).  Also, compositionally, I think it might have been better to be on the right side of the frame, since the chair is facing left.  Still overall, you''ve achieved the goal of making something mundane extraordinary!</td>', 'Very good lighting effect and I like the toning.  I know it''s difficult without editing but this would be improved withought the hotspots (mainly the one on the arm and the one showing through the back left of the chair).  Also, compositionally, I think it might have been better to be on the right side of the frame, since the chair is facing left.  Still overall, you''ve achieved the goal of making something mundane extraordinary!', '2004-02-29 23:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(603988, 61751, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute, and well captured.  I think perhaps it could use a splash of color ( ;-) )</td>', 'Cute, and well captured.  I think perhaps it could use a splash of color ( ;-) )', '2004-02-29 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(603990, 61807, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great abstract; good colors and composition!</td>', 'Great abstract; good colors and composition!', '2004-02-29 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(603994, 61816, 15330, '<td valign="top">The green tint is interesting, and looks very nice on the black bachground. I find the highlight a little too much, its too big and therfore distracting from the subject. You shouldn''t have cropped so close from the bottom that the screw is cut off. You should also try some more interesting perspectives than just straight down.</td>', 'The green tint is interesting, and looks very nice on the black bachground. I find the highlight a little too much, its too big and therfore distracting from the subject. You shouldn''t have cropped so close from the bottom that the screw is cut off. You should also try some more interesting perspectives than just straight down.', '2004-02-29 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(603997, 61444, 15330, '<td valign="top">The background is too distracting, all of the colors around the stapler are also distracting. You should try to isolate your subject. Also, try a more interesting composition.</td>', 'The background is too distracting, all of the colors around the stapler are also distracting. You should try to isolate your subject. Also, try a more interesting composition.', '2004-02-29 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(603998, 61727, 15360, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and great composition!</td>', 'Nice use of color and great composition!', '2004-02-29 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(604000, 61686, 15360, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a fun photograph!</td>', 'Nice capture of a fun photograph!', '2004-02-29 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(604002, 61618, 15360, '<td valign="top">Great use of color, nice composition</td>', 'Great use of color, nice composition', '2004-02-29 23:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(604003, 61795, 15360, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-02-29 23:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(604007, 61696, 8891, '<td valign="top">The absolute jmust mundane thing that you never want to think of and always have to use and its just there but not like this.  EXTRAORDINARY!  Love it. Love the select desat, the compostion , the great whoosh of the flush captured. EXCELLENT....oh BTW.....sorry...got to .....frame yeech!.....heck with it 10....gotta go....really....got... to....go.....!</td>', 'The absolute jmust mundane thing that you never want to think of and always have to use and its just there but not like this.  EXTRAORDINARY!  Love it. Love the select desat, the compostion , the great whoosh of the flush captured. EXCELLENT....oh BTW.....sorry...got to .....frame yeech!.....heck with it 10....gotta go....really....got... to....go.....!', '2004-02-29 23:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(604010, 61688, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very artistic composition. Love the colors that your were able to capture. The framing works in harmony with the shot. The colors really give a feeling of hands that have had a hard life. Interesting that certain colors will give a certain mood. From "8" to "9".</td>', 'Very artistic composition. Love the colors that your were able to capture. The framing works in harmony with the shot. The colors really give a feeling of hands that have had a hard life. Interesting that certain colors will give a certain mood. From "8" to "9".', '2004-02-29 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(604011, 61745, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I think a bit more contrast on the left side (or less light) would help to keep the details from fading.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I think a bit more contrast on the left side (or less light) would help to keep the details from fading.', '2004-02-29 23:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(604015, 61474, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting reflection to have on a teapot!</td>', 'That''s an interesting reflection to have on a teapot!', '2004-02-29 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(604018, 61518, 811, '<td valign="top">Very good use of shallow dof.  I like the composition as well -- it is balanced without being overbearing.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very good use of shallow dof.  I like the composition as well -- it is balanced without being overbearing.  Nice work.', '2004-02-29 23:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(604021, 61816, 8610, '<td valign="top">ahh the good good letherman.. You gotta love this tool.</td>', 'ahh the good good letherman.. You gotta love this tool.', '2004-02-29 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(604022, 61843, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus, composition, and the blue sky is beautiful.</td>', 'Good focus, composition, and the blue sky is beautiful.', '2004-02-29 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(604023, 61735, 10084, '<td valign="top">Simple but very interesting composition. Love the different textures that were captured.  The shapes of the subjects gives a pleasing focus to your eyes. The vibrant color of the one eye makes for a great focus point. "10"</td>', 'Simple but very interesting composition. Love the different textures that were captured.  The shapes of the subjects gives a pleasing focus to your eyes. The vibrant color of the one eye makes for a great focus point. "10"', '2004-02-29 23:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(604024, 61834, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome exposure!!</td>', 'Awesome exposure!!', '2004-02-29 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(604028, 61373, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s cool.  Spooky, but cool.  Nice shot.</td>', 'That''s cool.  Spooky, but cool.  Nice shot.', '2004-02-29 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(604029, 61648, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the color tones you have chosen to use.</td>', 'I like the color tones you have chosen to use.', '2004-02-29 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(604031, 61537, 15360, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  If you could have hidden the electrical cord more I think it would improve the shot.</td>', 'I like this picture.  If you could have hidden the electrical cord more I think it would improve the shot.', '2004-02-29 23:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(604033, 61465, 15360, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and a great title</td>', 'Nice focus and a great title', '2004-02-29 23:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(604035, 61734, 811, '<td valign="top">Very effective composition, I think.</td>', 'Very effective composition, I think.', '2004-02-29 23:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(604036, 61699, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I''ve seen others do this but I like the roof effect on the shadow here and the red toning (PS I presume)</td>', 'Excellent.  I''ve seen others do this but I like the roof effect on the shadow here and the red toning (PS I presume)', '2004-02-29 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(604037, 61807, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast, but I think if the focus was sharper, it would be more effective.</td>', 'I like the color contrast, but I think if the focus was sharper, it would be more effective.', '2004-02-29 23:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(604040, 61589, 8610, '<td valign="top">What is she thinking? Like this one a lot.</td>', 'What is she thinking? Like this one a lot.', '2004-02-29 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(604041, 61789, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2004-02-29 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(604043, 61458, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.   Well done composition and lay out.  Seems to have a fair amount of noise though, from looking at the bottom, which I think is why the nuts in the glasses don''t look as sharp as they could.</td>', 'Excellent idea.   Well done composition and lay out.  Seems to have a fair amount of noise though, from looking at the bottom, which I think is why the nuts in the glasses don''t look as sharp as they could.', '2004-02-29 23:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(604044, 61854, 811, '<td valign="top">Very simple, I like it. Good use of shallow dof.</td>', 'Very simple, I like it. Good use of shallow dof.', '2004-02-29 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(604048, 61731, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the color tones you have used, and the background works very well.  Great composition</td>', 'I really like the color tones you have used, and the background works very well.  Great composition', '2004-02-29 23:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(604050, 60991, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the purple color. You should have tried to make the highlighted square in the bottom left/right third, to improve composition.</td>', 'I like the purple color. You should have tried to make the highlighted square in the bottom left/right third, to improve composition.', '2004-02-29 23:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(604051, 61560, 6405, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10 negative space !</td>', 'Perfect 10 negative space !', '2004-02-29 23:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(604053, 61692, 6405, '<td valign="top">Wow,that is a long shot,you have good nerves 10 from me!</td>', 'Wow,that is a long shot,you have good nerves 10 from me!', '2004-02-29 23:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
