(605006, 60956, 14614, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for your comments.  I had high hopes for this one to place a bit better (scored sank big time at the end - it seemed you, the ones who took the time to comment, liked it) I enjoyed playing with a high key shot (glad a few noticed that was what I was doing!) and learned a bit more about it -- enough to try it again.</td>', 'Thanks to all for your comments.  I had high hopes for this one to place a bit better (scored sank big time at the end - it seemed you, the ones who took the time to comment, liked it) I enjoyed playing with a high key shot (glad a few noticed that was what I was doing!) and learned a bit more about it -- enough to try it again.', '2004-03-01 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
