(605223, 61686, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really fun image. You certainly captured an interesting shot of a mundane item (in England, at least). Fine work and congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Really fun image. You certainly captured an interesting shot of a mundane item (in England, at least). Fine work and congratulations on the ribbon!', '2004-03-02 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(605307, 61720, 1031, '<td valign="top">I guess I should have added my subtitle, "License Plate." I take a lot of pictures of personalized plates, so they are a pretty mundane object to me ... and I thought that the one rectangle among the light trails (and the colored trails themselves) was enough of a clue as to the main subject.<br/> <br/>Interestingly, this is a transplanted baseball fan -- it was shot in California.</td>', 'I guess I should have added my subtitle, "License Plate." I take a lot of pictures of personalized plates, so they are a pretty mundane object to me ... and I thought that the one rectangle among the light trails (and the colored trails themselves) was enough of a clue as to the main subject. Interestingly, this is a transplanted baseball fan -- it was shot in California.', '2004-03-02 01:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(605322, 61686, 8013, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  Although those phone boxes look cool (compared to the ones in Australia :-)</td>', 'Great shot!!  Although those phone boxes look cool (compared to the ones in Australia :-)', '2004-03-02 02:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
