(605640, 61743, 13152, '<td valign="top">Nice grad background and colour, but the ''ducks'' in a row composition isn''t terribly compelling. Watch the tension at the edge of the frame, too (shadow on the right).  A tighter arrangement and crop would have given the shot more drama and given you the opportunity to experiment with simulating the colours reflecting off each other. Use the blur tool a little to soften artefacts (particularly on the purple apple). Soldier on.</td>', 'Nice grad background and colour, but the ''ducks'' in a row composition isn''t terribly compelling. Watch the tension at the edge of the frame, too (shadow on the right).  A tighter arrangement and crop would have given the shot more drama and given you the opportunity to experiment with simulating the colours reflecting off each other. Use the blur tool a little to soften artefacts (particularly on the purple apple). Soldier on.', '2004-03-02 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(605910, 61759, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is awesome! So How did you do it? :O</td>', 'This picture is awesome! So How did you do it? :O', '2004-03-02 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
